acheProvider → ThemeProvider → CssBaseline → LocalizationProvider, InitColorSchemeScript)\n│       ├── not-found.tsx                # TASK-18\n│       ├── error.tsx                    # TASK-18\n│       ├── global-error.tsx             # TASK-18\n│       ├── forbidden/\n│       │   └── page.tsx                 # TASK-18 (403 slot, auth not wired)\n│       ├── api/\n│       │   └── health/\n│       │       └── route.ts             # TASK-6 (GET /api/health via withHandler)\n│       ├── (app)/\n│       │   ├── layout.tsx               # TASK-15 (sidebar Drawer + AppBar top bar)\n│       │   └── dashboard/\n│       │       └── page.tsx             # TASK-16 (PageHeader + EmptyState)\n│       └── (public)/\n│           ├── layout.tsx               # TASK-17 (public header/footer)\n│           └── page.tsx                 # TASK-17 (landing hero + Sign in CTA)\n│\n└── tests/\n    ├── unit/\n    │   ├── http.test.ts                           # TASK-21\n    │   ├── env.test.ts                             # TASK-21\n    │   ├── dates.test.ts                            # TASK-22\n    │   ├── DataTable.test.tsx                       # TASK-22\n    │   ├── ConfirmDialog.test.tsx                   # TASK-22\n    │   ├── useToast.test.tsx                        # TASK-22\n    │   └── eslint-no-restricted-imports.test.ts      # TASK-23\n    └── e2e/\n        ├── landing.spec.ts                          # TASK-24 (axe-core on /)\n        └── dashboard.spec.ts                        # TASK-24 (axe-core on /dashboard)\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- No auth system exists yet. `src/app/forbidden/page.tsx` and the user-menu\n  placeholder in `(app)/layout.tsx` (TASK-15/TASK-18) are UI slots only, per\n  FR-33/FR-39 — do not wire real sign-in/role logic.\n- `src/server/http.ts` (TASK-5) is the single chokepoint; `src/app/api/health/route.ts`\n  (TASK-6) is the only route and must not reimplement envelope/error logic.\n- All 10 shared components under `src/components/` are MUI compositions\n  (AD