src/app/(public)/layout.tsx renders a header (logo, school name, Sign in button to /login) and a footer with school address/phone/email from SchoolSettings.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 Public layout, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-37\", \"description\": \"/ renders a hero section with the school name, a one-sentence tagline, and the Sign in button.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 Public layout, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-38\", \"description\": \"Custom not-found.tsx (404), error.tsx (with a Try again button calling reset()), and global-error.tsx are implemented.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Error and status pages, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-39\", \"description\": \"/forbidden page shows a 403 message with a link back to /dashboard, for use by later PRDs.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Error and status pages, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-40\", \"description\": \"src/lib/logger.ts exports logger.info|warn|error(message, meta?) writing JSON lines in production and readable lines in development.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-9 Logging\" }\n  ],\n\n  \"nonFunctionalRequirements\": [\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-1\", \"description\": \"Material UI is the only permitted UI component/styling library; every component must be looked up via the MUI MCP server before use (useMuiDocs + fetchDocs), and a fixed list of alternative UI/styling libraries (Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Radix, Chakra, Ant Design, Bootstrap, lucide-react, next-themes, @tanstack/react-table, Recharts, FullCalendar, react-select, react-datepicker, sonner, notistack, etc.) is banned and enforced by ESLint.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"UI component rule (mandatory), items 1-6\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-2\", \"description\": \"/dashboard must reach Largest Contentful Paint under 2.5 seconds on a mid-range laptop running the production build.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 1 (Performance)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-3\", \"description\": \"All shared components meet WCAG 2.1 AA: visible focus rings, labelled controls, 4.5:1 colour contrast, full keyboard operability of sidebar/dialogs/menus; Playwright e2e runs @axe-core/playwright on / and /dashboard with zero serious/critical violations.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 2 (Accessibility)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-4\", \"description\": \"Layouts work from 360px to 1920px viewport width with no horizontal scroll.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 3 (Responsiveness)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-5\", \"description\": \"next.config.js sets security headers: X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin, X-Frame-Options: DENY, and a Content-Security-Policy restricted to self plus inline styles required by Next.js.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 4 (Security)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-6\", \"description\": \"Test harness uses Vitest + Testing Library for unit/component tests and Playwright for e2e (tests/e2e), covering withHandler branches, parsePagination, formatInSchoolTz, env.ts validation, DataTable/ConfirmDialog/useToast component behaviour, the no-restricted-imports lint rule, and the Playwright/axe scenarios listed in Test Requirements.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Test Requirements section\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-7\", \"description\": \"A fresh clone must be runnable end-to-end (docker compose up -d && npm install && npm run db:migrate && npm run db:seed && npm run dev) and viewable at localhost:3000 in under 5 minutes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Goals, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-8\", \"description\": \"npm run lint, npm run typecheck, npm run test and npm run test:e2e must all pass on a fresh clone.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Goals, item 3\" }\n  ],\n\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 100,\n  \"clarificationLog\": [],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","numLines":65,"startLine":1,"totalLines":65}}}
