{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011CTdm6Lzd5MS4hdenzTPiS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-2\",\n3\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n4\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-16T22:00:00Z\",\n5\t  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n6\t\n7\t  \"tasks\": [\n8\t    {\n9\t      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n10\t      \"description\": \"Extend prisma/schema.prisma with User, AuthToken, AuditLog models and the Role/UserStatus/AuthTokenType enums (brownfield addition alongside the existing SchoolSettings model, same DB/ORM, no new migration tooling).\",\n11\t      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n12\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n13\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n14\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-7\"]\n15\t    },\n16\t    {\n17\t      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n18\t      \"description\": \"Extend src/server/http.ts's ApiErrorCode union and ERROR_STATUS map with RATE_LIMITED (429), UNAUTHENTICATED (401), INVALID_TOKEN (410) — extend the one existing map, do not fork a second error-mapping file.\",\n19\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/http.ts\"],\n20\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n21\t      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n22\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-7\", \"NFR-8\"]\n23\t    },\n24\t    {\n25\t      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n26\t      \"description\": \"Password policy Zod schema (10-128 chars, letter+digit, not-email, not-common-password) in src/lib/validators/auth.ts, backed by a bundled 1,000-entry common-passwords list, exported for reuse by both server validation and the client-side live strength checklist.\",\n27\t      \"files\": [\"src/lib/validators/auth.ts\", \"src/lib/validators/common-passwords.json\"],\n28\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n29\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n30\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n31\t    },\n32\t    {\n33\t      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n34\t      \"description\": \"audit() insert-only helper in src/server/audit.ts: writes an AuditLog row, captures IP from x-forwarded-for when a request is passed, never throws (logs on failure instead), never writes password hashes/raw tokens/full passwords into metadata.\",\n35\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/audit.ts\"],\n36\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n37\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n38\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-8\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-1\"]\n39\t    },\n40\t    {\n41\t      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n42\t      \"description\": \"In-memory sliding-window rate limiter (src/server/rate-limit.ts) with a configurable key, covering both the sign-in limit (10/IP/5min) and the forgot-password limits (3/email/hr, 10/IP/hr) from one exported implementation.\",\n43\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/rate-limit.ts\"],\n44\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n45\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n46\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-17\"]\n47\t    },\n48\t    {\n49\t      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n50\t      \"description\": \"sendAuthEmail() stub in src/server/email/send-auth-email.ts logging recipient/subject/link via logger.info, with a stable signature so PRD-04 can swap the implementation later without touching call sites.\",\n51\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/email/send-auth-email.ts\"],\n52\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n53\t      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n54\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-27\"]\n55\t    },\n56\t    {\n57\t      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n58\t      \"description\": \"Shared token helper (src/server/auth/tokens.ts): crypto.randomBytes(32) base64url generation, crypto.createHash('sha256') hashing, crypto.timingSafeEqual lookup comparison, and revokeUnusedTokens(userId, type) — the one producer both the invite and reset flows call, so the reset-specific invalidate-on-reissue rule doesn't leak into the invite path.\",\n59\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/tokens.ts\"],\n60\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n61\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n62\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-18\", \"NFR-1\"]\n63\t    },\n64\t    {\n65\t      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n66\t      \"description\": \"Service layer src/server/services/users.ts: createUser (CONFLICT on duplicate email), createInviteToken, sendInvite, setUserStatus, unlockUser, plus the accept-invite atomic step (validate->hash->activate->mark-used->audit) and the reset-issuance/reset-password steps, all built on the existing Prisma singleton. Add bcrypt as a new dependency in package.json (cost-12 hashing).\",\n67\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/users.ts\", \"package.json\"],\n68\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-4\", \"TASK-6\", \"TASK-7\"],\n69\t      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n70\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-22\", \"NFR-7\"]\n71\t    },\n72\t    {\n73\t      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n74\t      \"description\": \"authorize() chokepoint (src/server/auth/authorize.ts): rate-limit check before DB work, email normalize, status/lockout branch, dummy bcrypt-compare for a non-existent user (timing safety), real bcrypt compare (cost 12), failedLoginCount/lockedUntil mutation, audit() calls for login.success/login.failure/lockout.\",\n75\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/authorize.ts\"],\n76\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-4\", \"TASK-5\"],\n77\t      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n78\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-3\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-5\", \"FR-8\", \"NFR-2\", \"NFR-3\"]\n79\t    },\n80\t    {\n81\t      \"id\": \"TASK-10\",\n82\t      \"description\": \"Same-origin callbackUrl guard (src/lib/callback-url.ts): returns the relative path when it's same-origin, else a /dashboard fallback.\",\n83\t      \"files\": [\"src/lib/callback-url.ts\"],\n84\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n85\t      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n86\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\"]\n87\t    },\n88\t    {\n89\t      \"id\": \"TASK-11\",\n90\t      \"description\": \"Auth.js (NextAuth v5) config (src/server/auth/config.ts): single Credentials provider calling authorize(), JWT session strategy (8h lifetime), jwt/session callbacks stamping id/role/firstName/lastName/email and applying the passwordChangedAt invalidation check throttled to once per 5 minutes; plus the App Router catch-all route re-exporting GET/POST handlers (serves /api/auth/callback/credentials, /session, /signout, /csrf).\",\n91\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/config.ts\", \"src/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts\"],\n92\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-9\", \"TASK-10\"],\n93\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n94\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"NFR-1\"]\n95\t    },\n96\t    {\n97\t      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n98\t      \"description\": \"middleware.ts perimeter: redirects unauthenticated (app) requests to /login?callbackUrl=<path>; returns 401 JSON for /api/* except /api/health, /api/auth/* and paths listed in the new src/config/public-routes.ts allowlist.\",\n99\t      \"files\": [\"middleware.ts\", \"src/config/public-routes.ts\"],\n100\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n101\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n102\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]\n103\t    },\n104\t    {\n105\t      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n106\t      \"description\": \"Permission helpers (src/server/auth/permissions.ts): getCurrentUser(), requireUser() (throws UNAUTHENTICATED / redirects to /login), requireRole(...roles) (throws FORBIDDEN / redirects to /forbidden) — no generic can() helper by design.\",\n107\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/permissions.ts\"],\n108\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n109\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n110\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-23\", \"NFR-8\"]\n111\t    },\n112\t    {\n113\t      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n114\t      \"description\": \"/login page: MUI Card/TextField/Button/InputAdornment+IconButton show-password toggle, Alert for form errors, submits via signIn('credentials'), honors the callbackUrl guard, aria-live=\\\"polite\\\" errors with focus-to-first-invalid-field.\",\n115\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(public)/login/page.tsx\"],\n116\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-10\", \"TASK-11\"],\n117\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n118\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-7\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n119\t    },\n120\t    {\n121\t      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n122\t      \"description\": \"Accept-invitation: POST /api/auth/invite/accept route (through http.ts's ok/apiError/withHandler/parseBody, 410 INVALID_TOKEN on bad/expired/used token) plus /invite/[token] page showing the invited user's name/email read-only with new/confirm-password fields and the live strength checklist.\",\n123\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/invite/accept/route.ts\", \"src/app/(public)/invite/[token]/page.tsx\"],\n124\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-7\", \"TASK-8\", \"TASK-11\"],\n125\t      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n126\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n127\t    },\n128\t    {\n129\t      \"id\": \"TASK-16\",\n130\t      \"description\": \"Forgot-password: POST /api/auth/forgot-password route (always-200 generic message, rate-limited 3/email/hr + 10/IP/hr) plus /forgot-password page with the email field and the same generic confirmation.\",\n131\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/forgot-password/route.ts\", \"src/app/(public)/forgot-password/page.tsx\"],\n132\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-8\"],\n133\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n134\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-18\"]\n135\t    },\n136\t    {\n137\t      \"id\": \"TASK-17\",\n138\t      \"description\": \"Reset-password: POST /api/auth/reset-password route (410 INVALID_TOKEN on bad/expired/used token, clears lockout fields, audits auth.password.reset) plus /reset-password/[token] page with new/confirm-password fields and the live strength checklist.\",\n139\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/reset-password/route.ts\", \"src/app/(public)/reset-password/[token]/page.tsx\"],\n140\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-7\", \"TASK-8\"],\n141\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n142\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"F