heck throttled to once per 5 minutes; plus the App Router catch-all route re-exporting GET/POST handlers (serves /api/auth/callback/credentials, /session, /signout, /csrf).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/config.ts\", \"src/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-9\", \"TASK-10\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"middleware.ts perimeter: redirects unauthenticated (app) requests to /login?callbackUrl=<path>; returns 401 JSON for /api/* except /api/health, /api/auth/* and paths listed in the new src/config/public-routes.ts allowlist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"middleware.ts\", \"src/config/public-routes.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"Permission helpers (src/server/auth/permissions.ts): getCurrentUser(), requireUser() (throws UNAUTHENTICATED / redirects to /login), requireRole(...roles) (throws FORBIDDEN / redirects to /forbidden) — no generic can() helper by design.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/permissions.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-23\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"/login page: MUI Card/TextField/Button/InputAdornment+IconButton show-password toggle, Alert for form errors, submits via signIn('credentials'), honors the callbackUrl guard, aria-live=\\\"polite\\\" errors with focus-to-first-invalid-field.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(public)/login/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-10\", \"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-7\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Accept-invitation: POST /a