current session token) plus /account/security page with current/new/confirm-password fields and the live strength checklist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/change-password/route.ts\", \"src/app/(app)/account/security/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-8\", \"TASK-11\", \"TASK-13\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-19\",\n      \"description\": \"App shell integration: replace shell.tsx's PLACEHOLDER_USER with the real session (name/role badge/avatar initials, sign-out via signOut()), add the 'Account security' menu entry, have layout.tsx pass the real session down, and switch navigation.ts's filter call from the placeholder role to the session's real role (verify the existing filter signature rather than rewriting it, per FR-26's MEDIUM-confidence note).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/layout.tsx\", \"src/app/(app)/shell.tsx\", \"src/config/navigation.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\", \"TASK-13\", \"TASK-18\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-21\", \"FR-25\", \"FR-26\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-20\",\n      \"description\": \"Seed six ACTIVE users (admin, two teachers, two students, one parent; password SchoolHub123!) and one INVITED user via the service layer's createUser/createInviteToken, logging the invited user's invite link through sendAuthEmail.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/seed.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-28\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-21\",\n      \"description\": \"Vitest unit tests: password-policy rule coverage, token hash/expiry/revoke behaviour, rate-limiter sliding-window boundaries, callbackUrl same-origin guard.\",\n      \"files\": [\"tests/unit/auth-validators.test.ts\", \"tests/unit/tokens.test.ts\", \"tests/unit/r