{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GJtvHd73QcbMN2QPWzAxGE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-02\",\n3\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n4\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T13:50:00Z\",\n5\t  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n6\t\n7\t  \"notes\": [\n8\t    \"No system-design.md exists for abcd-02 (arch-design-system left a stale abcd-2 copy; see artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json blockers). This plan is derived directly from artifacts/intake/requirements.json (ticketId abcd-02, read from the canonical /Users/ikramaansari/artifacts/intake/ location since this project's artifacts/intake/ also holds stale abcd-2 data) and artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json, cross-checked against the live prisma/schema.prisma and src/ tree.\",\n9\t    \"requireRole() and audit() are assumed 'existing' by the PRD (NFR-9) but were never created: PRD-01/ticket abcd-2's dev phase did not land (artifacts/dev/dev-rerun-count.json shows firstPassAccepted: false, 3 reruns), so src/ has no auth wiring at all — AppShell still runs on a hardcoded PLACEHOLDER_USER. TASK-2 adds minimal, single-chokepoint stand-ins (consistent with that existing placeholder pattern) so every write endpoint has exactly one place to swap in real session logic once PRD-01 lands, instead of 6 services duplicating ad hoc role checks.\"\n10\t  ],\n11\t\n12\t  \"tasks\": [\n13\t    {\n14\t      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n15\t      \"description\": \"Add Prisma models AcademicYear, Term, GradeLevel, Subject, Room to schema.prisma (unique constraints, onDelete: Restrict on Term.academicYear, archivedAt soft-delete fields) and generate the migration.\",\n16\t      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n17\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n18\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n19\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\"]\n20\t    },\n21\t    {\n22\t      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n23\t      \"description\": \"Create the shared requireRole() server-side role-check chokepoint and audit() AuditLog-insert helper that every write endpoint in this ticket calls.\",\n24\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/requireRole.ts\", \"src/server/audit.ts\"],\n25\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n26\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n27\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\", \"NFR-7\"]\n28\t    },\n29\t    {\n30\t      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n31\t      \"description\": \"Create a shared date-range overlap/containment validation utility reused by both the academic-years and terms services inside DB transactions.\",\n32\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/dateRange.ts\"],\n33\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n34\t      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n35\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\"]\n36\t    },\n37\t    {\n38\t      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n39\t      \"description\": \"Extend prisma/seed.ts: academic year 2026-2027 (current) with Semester 1/2, grade levels G6/G7/G8, six named subjects with codes, five named rooms with capacities.\",\n40\t      \"files\": [\"prisma/seed.ts\"],\n41\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n42\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n43\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\"]\n44\t    },\n45\t    {\n46\t      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n47\t      \"description\": \"Academic-years service: create/update inside a transaction with overlap validation, set-current transaction (one true, rest false), delete-in-use guard, getCurrentAcademicYear()/getCurrentTerm(date).\",\n48\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/academicYears.ts\"],\n49\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\"],\n50\t      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n51\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-7\"]\n52\t    },\n53\t    {\n54\t      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n55\t      \"description\": \"Academic-years API routes: GET/POST list+create, PATCH/DELETE by id, POST set-current. Role-gated writes, audit on write, shared envelope.\",\n56\t      \"files\": [\n57\t        \"src/app/api/academic-years/route.ts\",\n58\t        \"src/app/