 false, 3 reruns), so src/ has no auth wiring at all — AppShell still runs on a hardcoded PLACEHOLDER_USER. TASK-2 adds minimal, single-chokepoint stand-ins (consistent with that existing placeholder pattern) so every write endpoint has exactly one place to swap in real session logic once PRD-01 lands, instead of 6 services duplicating ad hoc role checks.\"\n  ],\n\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Add Prisma models AcademicYear, Term, GradeLevel, Subject, Room to schema.prisma (unique constraints, onDelete: Restrict on Term.academicYear, archivedAt soft-delete fields) and generate the migration.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the shared requireRole() server-side role-check chokepoint and audit() AuditLog-insert helper that every write endpoint in this ticket calls.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/requireRole.ts\", \"src/server/audit.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Create a shared date-range overlap/containment validation utility reused by both the academic-years and terms services inside DB transactions.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/dateRange.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Extend prisma/seed.ts: academic year 2026-2027 (current) with Semester 1/2, grade levels G6/G7/G8, six named subjects with codes, five named rooms with capacities.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/seed.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"Academic-years service: create/update inside a transaction with overlap validation, set-current transaction (one true, rest false), delete-in-use guard, getCurrentAcademicYear()/getCurrentTerm(date).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/academicYears.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Academic-years API routes: GET/POST list+create, PATCH/DELETE by id, POST set-current. Role-gated writes, audit on write, shared envelope.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/academic-years/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/set-current/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-5\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-19\", \"NFR-6\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"Terms service: create/update with range-inside-year + sibling-overlap validation, order auto-assign (max+1), generate-terms day-splitting (semesters/trimesters/quarters, earlier terms get the remainder day), reorder.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/terms.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-5\", \"TASK-3\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"Terms API routes: POST create-under-year, POST generate, PATCH/DELETE by id, POST reorder.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/terms/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/terms/generate/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/terms/[id]/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/terms/reorder/route.ts\"\n      ],\n   