{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01676m3H49uyWzPxb5b4QqVr","type":"tool_result","content":"### FR-1\nAdd Prisma models AcademicYear, Term, GradeLevel, Subject and Room exactly as specified (unique constraints, onDelete: Restrict on Term.academicYear, archivedAt soft-delete fields).\n\n### FR-2\nSchool settings screen (/admin/settings/school): form over every editable SchoolSettings field, with timezone as a searchable select of IANA zone names via Intl.supportedValuesOf('timeZone').\n\n### FR-3\nLogo is a plain URL field in this PRD; PRD-08 will later replace it with an upload control.\n\n### FR-4\nSaving school settings writes an audit entry settings.school.update with changed field names in metadata.\n\n### FR-5\ngetSchoolSettings() in src/server/services/settings.ts is cached per request via React cache(); the top bar and public footer consume it.\n\n### FR-6\nAcademic years screen (/admin/academic-years): table with name, start date, end date, term count, current badge, actions.\n\n### FR-7\nCreate/edit academic-year dialog validates end date after start date and that the date range does not overlap any other academic year, surfacing 'Dates overlap with <year>.'\n\n### FR-8\n'Set as current' action (behind a confirm dialog) sets isCurrent = true on the chosen year and false on all others inside one transaction.\n\n### FR-9\nDeleting an academic year is blocked (action disabled, tooltip 'In use — cannot delete') unless it has zero terms and is referenced by no other record.\n\n### FR-10\ngetCurrentAcademicYear() returns the current year with terms ordered by order (or null); getCurrentTerm(date = today) returns the term containing the date in the school timezone (or null).\n\n### FR-11\nWhen no academic year is marked current, every admin page shows a dismissible banner: 'No current academic year is set. Set one in Academic Years.'\n\n### FR-12\nAcademic year detail page (/admin/academic-years/[id]) lists the year's terms in order with inline create, edit and delete.\n\n### FR-13\nTerm validation: dates must fall inside the academic year's range and must not overlap sibling terms; order auto-assigns as max+1 and is editable via drag handle or up/down buttons.\n\n### FR-14\nTerm dialogs use MUI X DatePicker; a 'Generate terms' shortcut (2 semesters / 3 trimesters / 4 quarters) splits the year range into equal consecutive, named, contiguous terms, and is available only when the year has zero terms.\n\n### FR-15\nGrade levels screen (/admin/grade-levels): table with name, short name, order, active-student-count column (shows '—' until PRD-03 exists), status; create/edit dialog; reorder via up/down buttons; archive/unarchive instead of delete when referenced.\n\n### FR-16\nSubjects screen (/admin/subjects): table with colour swatch, name, code, description, status, searchable by name/code; create/edit dialog with a 12-swatch MUI ToggleButtonGroup colour picker (each swatch >=4.5:1 contrast, each with an aria-label naming the colour); code is stored upper-case and a duplicate code surfaces a field error 'Code already used by <subject>.'\n\n### FR-17\nRooms screen (/admin/rooms): table with name, building, capacity, status; create/edit/archive.\n\n### FR-18\nAdd an 'Administration' sidebar group (ADMIN role only) in src/config/navigation.ts linking to School settings, Academic years, Grade levels, Subjects and Rooms.\n\n### FR-19\nREST surface: GET/PATCH /api/settings/school; GET/POST /api/academic-years, PATCH/DELETE /api/academic-years/:id, POST .../set-current, POST .../terms, POST .../terms/generate; PATCH/DELETE /api/terms/:id, POST /api/terms/reorder; GET/POST + PATCH for /api/grade-levels, /api/subjects, /api/rooms — per the role/body table, with archive/unarchive as PATCH { archived } and an audit row per write.\n\n### FR-20\nSeed data: academic year 2026–2027 (current) with Semester 1 and Semester 2; grade levels G6/G7/G8; six named subjects with codes; five named rooms with capacities.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1a784f8-378b-420c-a5fd-aba631abc12f","uuid":"b13a802f-062b-4830-8d2a-94310a3f3bc2","timestamp":"2026-10-19T08:58:35.984Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### FR-1\nAdd Prisma models AcademicYear, Term, GradeLevel, Subject and Room exactly as specified (unique constraints, onDelete: Restrict on Term.academicYear, archivedAt soft-delete fields).\n\n### FR-2\nSchool settings screen (/admin/settings/school): form over every editable SchoolSettings field, with timezone as a searchable select of IANA zone names via Intl.supportedValuesOf('timeZone').\n\n### FR-3\nLogo is a plain URL field in this PRD; PRD-08 will later replace it with an upload control.\n\n### FR-4\nSaving school settings writes an audit entry settings.school.update with changed field names in metadata.\n\n### FR-5\ngetSchoolSettings() in src/server/services/settings.ts is cached per request via React cache(); the top bar and public footer consume it.\n\n### FR-6\nAcademic years screen (/admin/academic-years): table with name, start date, end date, term count, current badge, actions.\n\n### FR-7\nCreate/edit academic-year dialog validates end date after start date and that the date range does not overlap any other academic year, surfacing 'Dates overlap with <year>.'\n\n### FR-8\n'Set as current' action (behind a confirm dialog) sets isCurrent = true on the chosen year and false on all others inside one transaction.\n\n### FR-9\nDeleting an academic year is blocked (action disabled, tooltip 'In use — cannot delete') unless it has zero terms and is referenced by no other record.\n\n### FR-10\ngetCurrentAcademicYear() returns the current year with terms ordered by order (or null); getCurrentTerm(date = today) returns the term containing the date in the school timezone (or null).\n\n### FR-11\nWhen no academic year is marked current, every admin page shows a dismissible banner: 'No current academic year is set. Set one in Academic Years.'\n\n##