{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FSc9pnKtqvErGRZpV38ymJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",\n3\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n4\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:10:00Z\",\n5\t  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n6\t\n7\t  \"notes\": [\n8\t    \"Sequencing dependency carried from architect (system-design.md Status / handoff-to-dev-planning.json blocker, advisory): PRD-01 (real auth/session) has not landed in src/ — only requireRole.ts's ADMIN placeholder and the relevant Prisma columns (User.lockedUntil/failedLoginCount/passwordChangedAt, AuthToken) exist. TASK-6 (src/server/services/users.ts) implements sendInvite(userId) as a stub behind the same placeholder convention requireRole.ts already establishes (log + no-op), so TASK-9's /invite route and TASK-23's 'send invitation now' checkbox call the real interface name now and need zero call-site changes when PRD-01 lands. Likewise TASK-9's /status route only guarantees status=DISABLED is correct the instant it commits; the 'sessions stop within 5 minutes' effect (FR-12) is PRD-01's session-refresh check re-reading status, not rebuilt here (NFR-7).\",\n9\t    \"FR-31 (POST /api/users/:id/unlock) is MEDIUM confidence per intake/architect: TASK-6/TASK-9 clear exactly lockedUntil and failedLoginCount, the two fields already in prisma/schema.prisma. No other lockout field exists in the current schema (verified in TASK-1's read of prisma/schema.prisma), so this is implemented as specified.\",\n10\t    \"navigation.ts currently has no 'Administration' group concept (PRD-02's grouped-sidebar work did not land — artifacts/dev/dev-rerun-count.json shows its dev phase never passed). TASK-25 adds flat NavItem entries (Users, Import users, Audit log, My children) matching the existing flat-array pattern rather than inventing new grouping UI, per NFR-8 (no scope beyond this PRD's sections). shell.tsx's existing 'Profile' MenuItem is a dead button today (no href) — TASK-25 wires it to /account/profile.\",\n11\t    \"NFR-5 (MUI-only UI), NFR-7 (brownfield reuse discipline) and NFR-8 (lint/typecheck/test stay green, no scope creep) are cross-cutting constraints every task must satisfy, not separable file-level work — system-design.md's own traceability table assigns them to 'Component 21 (reuses existing components, no new files)' and 'all components,' not a dedicated component. No task cites them as a primary requirementId for that reason; they are enforced by how each task above is written (reuse DataTable/ConfirmDialog/UserAvatar/EmptyState/FormField/PageHeader/Toast, reuse requireRole()/audit()/http.ts helpers, additive-only schema and routes) rather than by a TASK-N that builds them.\"\n12\t  ],\n13\t\n14\t  \"tasks\": [\n15\t    {\n16\t      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n17\t      \"description\": \"Add StudentProfile, TeacherProfile, ParentProfile, ParentStudentLink models and Gender/GuardianRelationship enums to schema.prisma, with relations from User, and the (lastName, firstName, email) composite index on User; generate the migration.\",\n18\t      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n19\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n20\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n21\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-2\"]\n22\t    },\n23\t    {\n24\t      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n25\t      \"description\": \"Shared CSV util: escapeCsvCell() (leading =,+,-,@ -> apostrophe-prefixed) and toCsv(), the single choke point used by every CSV-generation path (export, import error report).\",\n26\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/csv.ts\"],\n27\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n28\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n29\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]\n30\t    },\n31\t    {\n32\t      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n33\t      \"description\": \"Read-only GET /api/audit-logs over the existing AuditLog table with actorId/actionPrefix/dateFrom/dateTo filters and pagination; no new write path.\",\n34\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/audit-logs/route.ts\"],\n35\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n36\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n37\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]\n38\t    },\n39\t    {\n40\t      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n41\t      \"description\": \"Shared Zod schemas (one per entity: student/teacher/parent row) for DOB 3-21yo and phone ^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$ validation, used as both the RHF resolver and the CSV row validator — single source of truth.\",\n42\t      \"files\": [\"src/lib/validators/users.ts\"],\n43\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n44\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n45\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-20\"]\n46\t    },\n47\t    {\n48\t      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n49\t      \"description\": \"linkParentToStudent/unlinkParentFromStudent: inside one transaction, reject a 5th link for a student and clear isPrimary on every other link when the new link sets isPrimary=true.\",\n50\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/userLinks.ts\"],\n51\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n52\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n53\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n54\t    },\n55\t    {\n56\t      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n57\t      \"description\": \"Core user service: createUser/updateUser (role immutable, email-change invalidates pending INVITE AuthTokens)/listUsers (filtered, paginated, uses the new index)/getUserDetail (profile+links+20 recent audit rows)/setUserStatus/archiveUser/restoreUser/unlockUser (clears lockedUntil+failedLoginCount), admissionNumber (S<year>-####)/employeeNumber (T-####) generators, self-disable and last-active-admin guards, and sendInvite(userId) as a stubbed PRD-01 interface (see notes).\",\n58\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/users.ts\"],\n59\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-4\"],\n60\t      \"estimateHours\": 6,\n61\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-31\"]\n62\t    },\n63\t    {\n64\t      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n65\t      \"description\": \"getAccessibleStudentIds(user) (ADMIN->'ALL', STUDENT->[self], PARENT->linked ids via userLinks, TEACHER->[] until PRD-05) and assertCanViewStudent(user, studentId) (FORBIDDEN/NOT_FOUND, never revealing existence to STUDENT/PARENT).\",\n66\t      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/student-access.ts\"],\n67\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-5\"],\n68\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n69\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-25\", \"NFR-1\"]\n70\t    },\n71\t    {\n72\t      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n73\t      \"description\": \"GET/POST /api/users (list with role/status/gradeLevelId/q/includeArchived filters + pagination; create) and GET/PATCH /api/users/:id (detail; update with server-side role-immutability rejection).\",\n74\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/users/route.ts\", \"src/app/api/users/[id]/route.ts\"],\n75\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\", \"TASK-4\"],\n76\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n77\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"NFR-2\"]\n78\t    },\n79\t    {\n80\t      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n81\t      \"description\": \"POST /api/users/:id/{invite,unlock,status,archive,restore}: resend invite, clear lockout fields, set ACTIVE/DISABLED with self/last-admin guard, archive (archivedAt+DISABLED), restore (clear archivedAt). All audit() on write.\",\n82\t      \"files\": [\n83\t        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/invite/route.ts\",\n84\t        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/unlock/route.ts\",\n85\t        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/status/route.ts\",\n86\t        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/archive/route.ts\",\n87\t        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/restore/route.ts\"\n88\t      ],\n89\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\"],\n90\t      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n91\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-31\"]\n92\t    },\n93\t    {\n94\t      \"id\": \"TASK-10\",\n95\t      \"description\": \"GET /api/users/export (same filters as list, text/csv, medicalNotes omitted, every cell through escapeCsvCell) and GET /api/users/search (ADMIN/TEACHER, <=20 rows, {id,name,email,role}, archived excluded).\",\n96\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/users/export/route.ts\", \"src/app/api/users/search/route.ts\"],\n97\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\", \"TASK-2\"],\n98\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n99\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-5\", \"FR-28\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]\n100\t    },\n101\t    {\n102\t      \"id\": \"TASK-11\",\n103\t      \"description\": \"Server-side import batch transaction: re-validates every row against TASK-4's schemas (never trusts the client), one prisma.$transaction per 200-row batch (all-or-rollback), case-insensitive grade-level match by name/shortName, strict YYYY-MM-DD dates, existing-email rows skipped not errored; plus the two static downloadable CSV templates.\",\n104\t      \"files\": [\n105\t        \"src/server/services/userImport.ts\",\n106\t        \"public/templates/students-template.csv\",\n107\t        \"public/templates/teachers-template.csv\"\n108\t      ],\n109\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-4\", \"TASK-6\", \"TASK-5\"],\n110\t      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n111\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-3\"]\n112\t    },\n113\t    {\n114\t      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n115\t      \"description\": \"POST /api/students/:id/parents (link, 5th-link/single-primary invariants via TASK-5) and DELETE /api/students/:id/parents/:parentId (unlink).\",\n116\t      \"files\": [\n117\t        \"src/app/api/students/[id]/parents/route.ts\",\n118\t        \"src/app/api/students/[id]/parents/[parentId]/route.ts\"\n119\t      ],\n120\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-5\"],\n121\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n122\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n123\t    },\n124\t    {\n125\t      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n126\t      \"description\": \"GET /api/students/:id gated by assertCanViewStudent, medicalNotes stripped server-side for STUDENT/PARENT before the response is built.\",\n127\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/students/[id]/route.ts\"],\n128\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-7\"],\n129\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n130\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-24\", \"FR-25\", \"NFR-1\"]\n131\t    },\n132\t    {\n133\t      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n134\t      \"description\": \"GET /api/me/children (PARENT, linked children for My Children) and PATCH /api/me/profile (self only; phone + occupation/address for PARENT; name/email/role read-only here).\",\n135\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/me/children/route.ts\", \"src/app/api/me/profile/route.ts\"],\n136\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-4\"],\n137\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n138\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\", \"FR-27\"]\n139\t    },\n140\t    {\n141\t      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n142\t      \"description\": \"POST /api/users/import: accepts type+rows+sendInvites, calls TASK-11's batch transaction, returns summary + per-row results + error-report CSV URL via TASK-2's csv util.\",\n143\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/users/import/route.ts\"],\n144\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\", \"TASK-2\"],\n145\t      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n146\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-3\"]\n147\t    },\n148\t    {\n149\t      \"id\": \"TASK-16\",\n150\t      \"description\": \"Reusable UserPicker on MUI Autocomplete (async, multiple, avatar+name+role renderOption) consuming GET /api/users/search.\",\n151\t      \"files\": [\"src/components/UserPicker/UserPicker.tsx\"],\n152\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-10\"],\n153\t      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n154\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-28\"]\n155\t    },\n156\t    {\n157\t      \"id\": \"TASK-17\",\n158\t      \"description\": \"/admin/users list page: DataTable (avatar+name, email, role chip, status chip, grade level, last sign-in, actions), role/status/gradeLevel/search/show-archived filters, row actions (View/Edit/Resend/Unlock/Disable-Enable/Archive-Restore) and bulk actions (Resend/Disable/Export CSV) via ConfirmDialog for destructive ones.\",\n159\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/users/page.tsx\"],\n160\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\", \"TASK-9\", \"TASK-10\"],\n161\t      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n162\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-5\"]\n163\t    },\n164\t    {\n165\t      \"id\": \"TASK-18\",\n166\t      \"description\": \"/admin/users/[id] detail page: profile data, status, last sign-in, linked family members, 20 most recent audit entries.\",\n167\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/users/[id]/page.tsx\"],\n168\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\"],\n169\t      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n170\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]\n171\t    },\n172\t    {\n173\t      \"id\": \"TASK-19\",\n174\t      \"description\": \"/admin/users/import page: template download links, 2 MB/2,000-row cap enforced before upload, papaparse preview DataGrid with per-row Valid/Warning/Error + per-cell reason, batched POST in chunks of 200, post-import summary + error-report download.\",\n175\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/users/import/page.tsx\"],\n176\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-15\"],\n177\t      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n178\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\"]\n179\t    },\n180\t    {\n181\t      \"id\": \"TASK-20\",\n182\t      \"description\": \"/students/[studentId] header (avatar, name, admission number, grade level, status) + Overview tab (profile, family, emergency contact; medicalNotes shown only for ADMIN/TEACHER) registered in student-tabs.ts.\",\n183\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/students/[studentId]/page.tsx\", \"src/config/student-tabs.ts\"],\n184\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-13\", \"TASK-7\"],\n185\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n186\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-24\", \"FR-25\"]\n187\t    },\n188\t    {\n189\t      \"id\": \"TASK-21\",\n190\t      \"description\": \"/my-children (PARENT only): cards (name, grade level, admission number) linking to the student detail page, EmptyState when none linked.\",\n191\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/my-children/page.tsx\"],\n192\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-14\"],\n193\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n194\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\"]\n195\t    },\n196\t    {\n197\t      \"id\": \"TASK-22\",\n198\t      \"description\": \"/account/profile: read-only name/email/role, editable phone (+occupation/address for PARENT) via PATCH /api/me/profile.\",\n199\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/account/profile/page.tsx\"],\n200\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-14\"],\n201\t      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n202\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-27\"]\n203\t    },\n204\t    {\n205\t      \"id\": \"TASK-23\",\n206\t      \"description\": \"Create/edit user flow: shared UserFormStepper (role select -> common + role-specific fields, inline parent/student linking via UserPicker, 'Send invitation email now' checkbox default checked), new/page.tsx and [id]/edit/page.tsx (role read-only on edit, email-change confirm dialog).\",\n207\t      \"files\": [\n208\t        \"src/app/(app)/admin/users/new/page.tsx\",\n209\t        \"src/app/(app)/admin/users/[id]/edit/page.tsx\",\n210\t        \"src/app/(app)/admin/users/UserFormStepper.tsx\"\n211\t      ],\n212\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-4\", \"TASK-16\"],\n213\t      \"estimateHours\": 6,\n214\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n215\t    },\n216\t    {\n217\t      \"id\": \"TASK-24\",\n218\t      \"description\": \"/admin/audit-log: read-only table (time, actor, action, entityType, entityId linked when a user, IP) with actor/action-prefix/date-range filters, right Drawer with pretty-printed metadata JSON on row click.\",\n219\t      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/audit-log/page.tsx\"],\n220\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-3\"],\n221\t      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n222\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]\n223\t    },\n224\t    {\n225\t      \"id\": \"TASK-25\",\n226\t      \"description\": \"Add Users/Import users/Audit log (ADMIN) and My children (PARENT) entries to navigation.ts; wire shell.tsx's existing 'Profile' user-menu item to /account/profile (currently a dead button).\",\n227\t      \"files\": [\"src/config/navigation.ts\", \"src/app/(app)/shell.tsx\"],\n228\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-17\", \"TASK-19\", \"TASK-21\", \"TASK-22\", \"TASK-24\"],\n229\t      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n230\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-30\"]\n231\t    },\n232\t    {\n233\t      \"id\": \"TASK-26\",\n234\t      \"description\": \"Vitest unit tests: CSV row validator (TASK-4), admission/employee-number generator (TASK-6), escapeCsvCell/formula-injection escaping (TASK-2), getAccessibleStudentIds per role (TASK-7).\",\n235\t      \"files\": [\n236\t        \"tests/unit/userValidators.test.ts\",\n237\t        \"tests/unit/userNumberGenerators.test.ts\",\n238\t        \"tests/unit/csv.test.ts\",\n239\t        \"tests/unit/studentAccess.test.ts\"\n240\t      ],\n241\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-4\", \"TASK-2\", \"TASK-6\", \"TASK-7\"],\n242\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n243\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\"]\n244\t    },\n245\t    {\n246\t      \"id\": \"TASK-27\",\n247\t      \"description\": \"Vitest integration tests: import batch rollback on a failing row within a 200-row batch, the last-active-admin / self-disable guard, and primary-link uniqueness (set-one-clears-others, max-4 rejection).\",\n248\t      \"files\": [\n249\t        \"tests/unit/userImport.integration.test.ts\",\n250\t        \"tests/unit/users.integration.test.ts\",\n251\t        \"tests/unit/userLinks.integration.test.ts\"\n252\t      ],\n253\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-11\", \"TASK-15\"],\n254\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n255\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\", \"NFR-3\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-16\"]\n256\t    },\n257\t    {\n258\t      \"id\": \"TASK-28\",\n259\t      \"description\": \"Playwright e2e: create a student with an inline-linked parent, CSV import happy path with one deliberately bad row, parent My-children -> student detail page navigation.\",\n260\t      \"files\": [\"tests/e2e/user-management.spec.ts\"],\n261\t      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-23\", \"TASK-19\", \"TASK-20\", \"TASK-21\"],\n262\t      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n263\t      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\"]\n264\t    }\n265\t  ],\n266\t\n267\t  \"fileStructure\": {\n268\t    \"prisma/\": [\"schema.prisma\"],\n269\t    \"public/templates/\": [\"students-template.csv\", \"teachers-template.csv\"],\n270\t    \"src/lib/validators/\": [\"users.ts\"],\n271\t    \"src/server/\": [\"csv.ts\", \"auth/student-access.ts\", \"services/users.ts\", \"services/userLinks.ts\", \"services/userImport.ts\"],\n272\t    \"src/components/\": [\"UserPicker/\"],\n273\t    \"src/config/\": [\"navigation.ts\", \"student-tabs.ts\"],\n274\t    \"src/app/api/\": [\"users/\", \"students/\", \"me/\", \"audit-logs/\"],\n275\t    \"src/app/(app)/\": [\"shell.tsx\", \"admin/users/\", \"admin/audit-log/\", \"students/\", \"my-children/\", \"account/profile/\"],\n276\t    \"tests/\": [\"unit/\", \"e2e/\"]\n277\t  },\n278\t\n279\t  \"totalEstimateHours\": 73,\n280\t  \"nxpPatterns\": [],\n281\t  \"status\": \"complete\"\n282\t}\n283\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58cb2461-07a2-4908-85eb-953f83a6620f","uuid":"cbf1d337-fc84-436d-bc8c-e34cce93a98b","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:41:23.511Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/dev-planning/implementation-plan.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:10:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Sequencing dependency carried from architect (system-design.md Status / handoff-to-dev-planning.json blocker, advisory): PRD-01 (real auth/session) has not landed in src/ — only requireRole.ts's ADMIN placeholder and the relevant Prisma columns (User.lockedUntil/failedLoginCount/passwordChangedAt, AuthToken) exist. TASK-6 (src/server/services/users.ts) implements sendInvite(userId) as a stub behind the same placeholder convention requireRole.ts already establishes (log + no-op), so TASK-9's /invite route and TASK-23's 'send invitation now' checkbox call the real interface name now and need zero call-site changes when PRD-01 lands. Likewise TASK-9's /status route only guarantees status=DISABLED is correct the instant it commits; the 'sessions stop within 5 minutes' effect (FR-12) is PRD-01's session-refresh check re-reading status, not rebuilt here (NFR-7).\",\n    \"FR-31 (POST /api/users/:id/unlock) is MEDIUM confidence per intake/architect: TASK-6/TASK-9 clear exactly lockedUntil and failedLoginCount, the two fields already in prisma/schema.prisma. No other lockout field exists in the current schema (verified in TASK-1's read of prisma/schema.prisma), so this is implemented as specified.\",\n    \"navigation.ts currently has no 'Administration' group concept (PRD-02's grouped-sidebar work did not land — artifacts/dev/dev-rerun-count.json shows its dev phase never passed). TASK-25 adds flat NavItem entries (Users, Import users, Audit log, My children) matching the existing flat-array pattern rather than inventing new grouping UI, per NFR-8 (no scope beyond this PRD's sections). shell.tsx's existing 'Profile' MenuItem is a dead button today (no href) — TASK-25 wires it to /account/profile.\",\n    \"NFR-5 (MUI-only UI), NFR-7 (brownfield reuse discipline) and NFR-8 (lint/typecheck/test stay green, no scope creep) are cross-cutting constraints every task must satisfy, not separable file-level work — system-design.md's own traceability table assigns them to 'Component 21 (reuses existing components, no new files)' and 'all components,' not a dedicated component. No task cites them as a primary requirementId for that reason; they are enforced by how each task above is written (reuse DataTable/ConfirmDialog/UserAvatar/EmptyState/FormField/PageHeader/Toast, reuse requireRole()/audit()/http.ts helpers, additive-only schema and routes) rather than by a TASK-N that builds them.\"\n  ],\n\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Add StudentProfile, TeacherProfile, ParentProfile, ParentStudentLink models and Gender/GuardianRelationship enums to schema.prisma, with relations from User, and the (lastName, firstName, email) composite index on User; generate the migration.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Shared CSV util: escapeCsvCell() (leading =,+,-,@ -> apostrophe-prefixed) and toCsv(), the single choke point used by every CSV-generation path (export, import error report).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/csv.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Read-only GET /api/audit-logs over the existing AuditLog table with actorId/actionPrefix/dateFrom/dateTo filters and pagination; no new write path.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/audit-logs/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Shared Zod schemas (one per entity: student/teacher/parent row) for DOB 3-21yo and phone ^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$ validation, used as both the RHF resolver and the CSV row validator — single source of truth.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/lib/validators/users.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-20\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"linkParentToStudent/unlinkParentFromStudent: inside one transaction, reject a 5th link for a student and clear isPrimary on every other link when the new link sets isPrimary=true.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/userLinks.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Core user service: createUser/updateUser (role immutable, email-change invalidates pending INVITE AuthTokens)/listUsers (filtered, paginated, uses the new index)/getUserDetail (profile+links+20 recent audit rows)/setUserStatus/archiveUser/restoreUser/unlockUser (clears lockedUntil+failedLoginCount), admissionNumber (S<year>-####)/employeeNumber (T-####) generators, self-disable and last-active-admin guards, and sendInvite(userId) as a stubbed PRD-01 interface (see notes).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/users.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 6,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-31\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"getAccessibleStudentIds(user) (ADMIN->'ALL', STUDENT->[self], PARENT->linked ids via userLinks, TEACHER->[] until PRD-05) and assertCanViewStudent(user, studentId) (FORBIDDEN/NOT_FOUND, never revealing existence to STUDENT/PARENT).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/student-access.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-5\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-25\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"GET/POST /api/users (list with role/status/gradeLevelId/q/includeArchived filters + pagination; create) and GET/PATCH /api/users/:id (detail; update with server-side role-immutability re