ons; SectionsClient.tsx renders year filter, DataTable (name, grade, homeroom teacher, room, members/capacity with warning colour >=90%, course count, row link to detail), create/edit Dialog (grade level, name, UserPicker role=TEACHER homeroom, room, capacity; validated with sectionInputSchema), delete via ConfirmDialog, and 'Copy sections to next year' button enabled only when a future non-current year exists. Feedback via useToast. MUI only.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/sections/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/sections/SectionsClient.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-8\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-2\",\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"NFR-1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"/admin/sections/[id] page: server page.tsx loads section, members, courses, eligible students (sections-service.listEligibleStudents), active subjects; SectionDetailClient.tsx renders members DataTable with remove (ConfirmDialog) and 'Move to section…' row action (Dialog picking another section of the same year), 'Add students' Autocomplete multiple over eligible students with 'Override capacity' checkbox, section course list, and 'Create core courses' Dialog (checkbox + UserPicker role=TEACHER per active subject). CONFLICT messages surfaced via useToast.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/sections/[id]/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/sections/[id]/SectionDetailClient.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-8\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-9\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"NFR-1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"/admin/courses page: server page.tsx loads years, grade levels, subjects, sections; CoursesClient.tsx renders filters (year, grade, subject, teacher, kind, search) driving GET /api/courses, DataTable (code, name, subject colour Chip, section, teacher, enrolled count, kind, link to enrollment page), and create/edit Dialog (subject, section required iff CORE via courseInputSchema refinement, UserPicker teacher, UserPicker multiple co-teachers max 3, name, code auto-filled from subject+section and forced uppercase, kind, capacity, description) plus archive toggle.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/CoursesClient.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-9\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-13\",\n        \"FR-14\",\n        \"NFR-1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment page: server page.tsx loads course + full roster (getCourseRoster as ADMIN, status ALL); EnrollmentClient.tsx renders enrolled-students DataTable with Drop/Reactivate row actions (PATCH /api/enrollments/:id, override-capacity prompt on CONFLICT), 'Add students' UserPicker role=STUDENT multiple (POST /api/courses/:id/enrollments) — for CORE courses show an info Alert linking to the section and disable the picker.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment/EnrollmentClient.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-9\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-15\",\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"NFR-1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Course home: course-tabs.ts mirrors student-tabs.ts (key, label, href(courseId), roles) registering Overview (/courses/:id, all roles) and Roster (/courses/:id/roster, ADMIN/TEACHER/STUDENT; PARENT omitted). layout.tsx calls requireRole(...A