| Testing | playwright | — |\n\n## Architecture\n### Directory Structure\n- `.pdlc/`\n- `artifacts/`\n  - `artifacts/architect/`\n  - `artifacts/dev/`\n  - `artifacts/dev-planning/`\n  - `artifacts/intake/`\n  - `artifacts/telemetry/`\n- `prisma/`\n  - `prisma/migrations/`\n    - `prisma/migrations/20261019000000_init/`\n    - `prisma/migrations/20261019151500_user_management_profiles/`\n- `public/`\n  - `public/templates/`\n- `src/`\n  - `src/app/`\n    - `src/app/(app)/`\n      - `src/app/(app)/dashboard/`\n    - `src/app/(public)/`\n    - `src/app/api/`\n      - `src/app/api/academic-years/`\n        - `src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/`\n      - `src/app/api/audit-logs/`\n      - `src/app/api/grade-levels/`\n        - `src/app/api/grade-levels/[id]/`\n      - `src/app/api/health/`\n      - `src/app/api/me/`\n        - `src/app/api/me/children/`\n        - `src/app/api/me/profile/`\n      - `src/app/api/rooms/`\n        - `src/app/api/rooms/[id]/`\n      - `src/app/api/settings/`\n        - `src/app/api/settings/school/`\n      - `src/app/api/students/`\n        - `src/app/api/students/[id]/`\n      - `src/app/api/subjects/`\n        - `src/app/api/subjects/[id]/`\n      - `src/app/api/terms/`\n        - `src/app/api/terms/[id]/`\n        - `src/app/api/terms/reorder/`\n      - `src/app/api/users/`\n        - `src/app/api/users/[id]/`\n        - `src/app/api/users/export/`\n        - `src/app/api/users/import/`\n        - `src/app/api/users/search/`\n    - `src/app/forbidden/`\n  - `src/components/`\n    - `src/components/ConfirmDialog/`\n    - `src/components/DataTable/`\n    - `src/components/DateDisplay/`\n    - `src/components/EmptyState/`\n    - `src/components/FormField/`\n    - `src/components/LoadingSkeleton/`\n    - `src/components/PageHeader/`\n    - `src/components/StatCard/`\n    - `src/components/Toast/`\n    - `src/components/UserAvatar/`\n    - `src/components/UserPicker/`\n  - `src/config/`\n  - `src/lib/`\n    - `src/lib/validators/`\n  - `src/server/`\n    - `src/server/auth/`\n    - `src/server/services/`\n  - `src/theme/`\n- `tests/`\n  - `tests/e2e/`\n  - `tests/unit/`\n\n### Module Organization\n- component\n- config\n- route\n- service\n- test\n- utility\n\n### Patterns\n- State Management: context\n- Styling: emotion\n- Routing: next-router\n- Data Fetching: fetch\n\n## Execution Model\n\n### Concurrency\n- Promise.all parallelism (4 files)\n\n## System Segments\n| Segment | Purpose | Files | Depends On |\n|---------|---------|-------|------------|\n| `artifacts/` | Application module | 0 | — |\n| `prisma/` | Prisma schema and migrations | 2 | — |\n| `public/` | Static assets | 0 | — |\n| `src/` | Primary source code | 0 | — |\n| `tests/` | Test suites | 0 | — |\n\n## Architectural Patterns\n### Factory\n- **Category**: creational\n- **Evidence**: 12 create*() functions\n\n## Core Concepts\nClasses/types most referenced across the codebase:\n\n| Concept | Cross-file References |\n|---------|----------------------|\n| `AppError` | 33 |\n| `Role` | 22 |\n| `TxClient` | 10 |\n| `BaseProps` | 8 |\n| `UserPickerOption` | 7 |\n| `GuardianRelationship` | 7 |\n| `ToastOptions` | 4 |\n| `LogMeta` | 4 |\n| `ApiErrorCode` | 4 |\n| `DateRange` | 4 |\n| `SelectOption` | 3 |\n\n## API Surface\n### Endpoints\n| Method | Path | Description |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| GET | /api/users | ADMIN only. Paginated, filtered user list backed by the (lastName, firstName, email) index. |\n| POST | /api/users | ADMIN only. Creates a User + role-specific profile row + any inline parent/student links in one transaction; generates admissionNumber (S<year>-####) or employeeNumber (T-####) where applicable. |\n| GET | /api/users/:id | ADMIN only. Full user + role profile + family links (component 6) + 20 most recent AuditLog rows where actorId=id OR entityId=id. |\n| PATCH | /api/users/:id | ADMIN only. Updates common + profile fields. role is rejected server-side if present and different from the existing row (FR-9 is a service-layer invariant, not just a form convenience). An email diff invalidates (marks used) any pending AuthToken rows of type INVITE for this user. |\n| POST | /api/users/:id/invite | ADMIN only. Resends an invitation email via src/server/services/users.ts's sendInvite(userId) (PRD-01 interface; see note — stub/no-op until PRD-01 lands, call site does not change). |\n| POST | /api/users/:id/unlock | ADMIN only. Clears lockedUntil and failedLoginCount, restoring sign-in access immediately. MEDIUM confidence (FR-31) — field names confirmed against prisma/schema.prisma; verify no other lockout field exists before implementation. |\n| POST | /api/users/:id/status | ADMIN only. Sets status to ACTIVE or DISABLED. Rejects self-disable and disabling the last active ADMIN with VALIDATION_ERROR 'At least one active admin is required.' The 'sessions stop working within 5 minutes' effect (FR-12) is PRD-01's session re-check reading status on token refresh, not built here (NFR-7) — this endpoint only guarantees status is correct the instant the write commits. |\n| POST | /api/users/:id/archive | ADMIN only. Sets archivedAt=now and status=DISABLED. Same self/last-admin guard as /status. Archived users are excluded from every list/picker query by default (component 3/7/16), enforced at the query layer. |\n| POST | /api/users/:id/restore | ADMIN only. Clears archivedAt. Does not auto-reactivate status; an admin re-enables separately via /status. |\n| POST | /api/users/import | ADMIN only. Re-validates every row server-side (never trusts the client) against the same Zod schemas as the create form, in batches of 200; each batch runs in one prisma.$transaction (all-or-rollback, NFR-3). Grade levels matched case-insensitively by name/shortName; dates parsed strictly as YYYY-MM-DD; rows whose email already exists are skipped, not errored (FR-23). |\n| GET | /api/users/export | ADMIN only. Same filters as GET /api/users; returns text/csv. medicalNotes is excluded and every cell passes through escapeCsvCell() (NFR-4) to neutralise formula injection. |\n| GET | /api/users/search | ADMIN and TEACHER only. Picker search reusing the list query's filters, capped to 20 rows, projected down, excluding archived users. |\n| POST | /api/students/:id/parents | ADMIN only. Links a parent to a student inside one transaction: rejects a 5th link for the student (VALIDATION_ERROR) and, if isPrimary is true, clears isPrimary on every other link for that student first. |\n| DELETE | /api/students/:id/parents/:parentId | ADMIN only. Removes a parent-student link. |\n| GET | /api/students/:id | Gated by assertCanViewStudent (ADMIN/TEACHER full access; STUDENT self only; PARENT linked children only — FORBIDDEN or NOT_FOUND otherwise, never revealing existence to STUDENT/PARENT). medicalNotes is stripped in the service layer for STUDENT/PARENT roles before the response is built. |\n| GET | /api/me/children | PARENT only. Lists the caller's linked children for the My Children page. |\n| PATCH | /api/me/profile | Any authenticated user, self only. Narrower mutation path than /api/users/:id — editable fields are phone, plus occupation/address for PARENT role; name/email/role are read-only here. |\n| GET | /api/audit-logs | ADMIN only. Read-only paginated view over the existing AuditLog table; filters by actor, action prefix, and date range. No new write path. |\n\n### Authentication\nNone detected\n\n## Data Models\n### User\n_Source: sql-ddl:prisma/migrations/20261019000000_init/migration.sql_\n| Field | Type | Constraints |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| id | TEXT | notNull |\n| email | TEXT | notNull |\n| passwordHash | TEXT |  |\n| firstName | TEXT | notNull |\n| lastName | TEXT | notNull |\n| failedLoginCount | INTEGER | notNull, default |\n| lockedUntil | TIMESTAMP(3) |  |\n| lastLoginAt | TIMESTAMP(3) |  |\n| passwordChangedAt | TIMESTAMP(3) |  |\n| createdAt | TIMESTAMP(3) | notNull, default |\n| updatedAt | TIMESTAMP(3) | notNull |\n\n### AuthToken\n_Source: 