{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SqDWmhfV34UMjhTFtQrRyA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-20T07:24:57.408Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"count\": 3,\n  \"firstPassAccepted\": false\n}{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-05\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T17:00:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Prisma data layer: add enums CourseKind (CORE/ELECTIVE), EnrollmentStatus (ACTIVE/DROPPED) and models Section, SectionMember, Course (incl. coTeachers many-to-many to User, archivedAt), Enrollment exactly per FR-1 with @@unique([academicYearId,name]) on Section, @@unique([studentId,academicYearId]) on SectionMember, @@unique([academicYearId,code]) on Course, @@unique([courseId,studentId]) + @@index([studentId,status]) on Enrollment; add back-relations on User/AcademicYear/GradeLevel/Subject/Room. Generate the migration with `prisma migrate dev --create-only --name classes_enrollment` and rename its folder to the exact path listed.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"prisma/schema.prisma\",\n        \"prisma/migrations/20261027000000_classes_enrollment/migration.sql\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-1\",\n        \"NFR-2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Shared zod validators. sections.ts: sectionInputSchema (capacity int 1-60 default 30), sectionUpdateSchema (no academicYearId), enrollStudentsSchema ({studentIds min 1, overrideCapacity?}), moveSectionSchema, coreCoursesSchema (items min 1, unique subjectIds), copyToYearSchema, sections list query. courses.ts: courseInputSchema with ONE refinement 'sectionId required iff kind=CORE', coTeacherIds max 3, code uppercased transform; courseUpdateSchema (no academicYearId/sectionId/kind, plus archived?: boolean); enrollmentStatusSchema; courses list + roster query schemas. Client dialogs and API routes import the same schemas.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/lib/validators/sections.ts\",\n        \"src/lib/validators/courses.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-14\",\n        \"FR-23\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Roster Enrollment Engine (system-design component; tech-stack ADR-1/ADR-2). Every function takes a Prisma tx client first and never opens its own transaction: checkCapacityOrThrow(tx,{sectionId?|courseId?,addingCount,overrideCapacity}) -> AppError CONFLICT 'Section 7A is full (30/30).' / 'Course MATH-7A is full (30/30).'; enrollSectionCoreCourses (one findMany of existing pairs, one createMany skipDuplicates, one updateMany DROPPED->ACTIVE with droppedAt null; returns EnrollResult); dropSectionCoreCourses (updateMany ACTIVE->DROPPED, droppedAt now, CORE courses of that section only); moveStudentSection (drop then enroll). Also export the reactivate-or-create helper reused by courses-service for elective enrollments. Call audit() per logical change. No per-row loops (NFR-3).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/enrollment/roster-engine.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"FR-9\",\n        \"FR-10\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-24\",\n        \"NFR-3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Unit tests for the roster engine using a hand-rolled fake tx object (vi.fn() per Prisma method, no DB): capacity CONFLICT message + override bypass; enroll issues exactly one createMany + one updateMany for mixed new/DROPPED pairs; drop touches only CORE courses of the section; move calls drop then enroll.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/unit/roster-engine.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"FR-9\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"NFR-3\",\n        \"NFR-5\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"Course access + teacher student access (system-design Decision 2, ADR-4). course-access.ts: assertCanViewCourse(user, courseId) (ADMIN all; TEACHER teacher/co-teacher; STUDENT ACTIVE enrollment; PARENT any linked child ACTIVE enrollment via ParentStudentLink; NOT_FOUND for missing course, FORBIDDEN otherwise) and assertCanManageCourse(user, courseId) (ADMIN, teacher, co-teacher). User comes from requireRole(...); do NOT create permissions.ts/requireUser(). student-access.ts: replace the TEACHER branch of getAccessibleStudentIds with students ACTIVE in courses they teach/co-teach plus members of sections they are homeroom teacher of; signature unchanged.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/auth/course-access.ts\",\n        \"src/server/auth/student-access.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-18\",\n        \"FR-22\",\n        \"NFR-7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Sections service: listSections (year defaults to getCurrentAcademicYear; memberCount, courseCount, sort/q/page), getSection, createSection/updateSection (homeroom-teacher-once-per-year findFirst inside the write $transaction per Decision 3; capacity >= memberCount on update), deleteSection (CONFLICT if members or courses), listEligibleStudents(sectionId) (STUDENT, same grade level, no SectionMember this year — feeds the add picker), addMembers (tx: section capacity check, SectionMember createMany, map P2002 to friendly CONFLICT, enrollSectionCoreCourses), removeMember (tx: delete + dropSectionCoreCourses), moveStudent (one tx: remove + moveStudentSection; validates same year, different section), copySectionsToYear (structural Section copy, grade advanced by GradeLevel.order, top grade / name clashes reported in `skipped`, target must be future non-current year). All writes audit section.* / enrollment.*.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/sections/sections-service.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-2\",\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-2\",\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"FR-9\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-24\",\n        \"NFR-2\",\n        \"NFR-6\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"Courses service: listCourses (filters per api-contracts; ADMIN all, TEACHER taught/co-taught, STUDENT/PARENT ACTIVE enrollment of self/child; excludes archived unless includeArchived; enrolledCount ACTIVE only), getCourse, createCourse (tx; CORE -> enrollSectionCoreCourses with current section members, FR-10), createCoreCourses(sectionId, items) (tx; default name '<Subject> – <Section>', code '<SUBJECTCODE>-<SECTION>', non-archived subjects only, then enroll members per course), updateCourse (immutable academicYearId/sectionId/kind, archive/unarchive, capacity >= enrolledCount), getCourseRoster(courseId, viewerRole, query) (STUDENT projection = names only, ACTIVE only — NFR-4, single implementation shared by Roster tab + API), enrollStudentsInCourse (CONFLICT for CORE 'Core course enrollment is managed via section 7A.'; capacity check + reactivate-or-create helper from roster engine), setEnrollmentStatus (DROPPED sets droppedAt; ACTIVE clears + capacity check), listMyCourses(user) (TEACHER/STUDENT/PARENT-grouped-by-child shapes; ADMIN empty), getStudentCourses(studentId) (this year's courses + teacher + status + section + homeroom teacher). Writes audit course.* / enrollment.*.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/courses/courses-service.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-2\",\n        \"TASK-3\",\n        \"TASK-5\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-10\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-13\",\n        \"FR-14\",\n        \"FR-15\",\n        \"FR-17\",\n        \"FR-19\",\n        \"FR-21\",\n        \"FR-24\",\n        \"NFR-4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"Section API routes, thin handlers (withHandler -> requireRole -> parseBody/parseQuery with TASK-2 schemas -> one service call -> ok()/paginated() with status 201 on creates): GET/POST /api/sections (GET: ADMIN,TEACHER; writes ADMIN), PATCH/DELETE /api/sections/:id, POST /api/sections/:id/members, DELETE /api/sections/:id/members/:studentId, POST /api/sections/:id/core-courses (courses-service.createCoreCourses), POST /api/sections/copy-to-year, POST /api/students/:id/move-section. Next 14 route params signature `(req, { params })`.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/sections/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/sections/[id]/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/sections/[id]/members/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/sections/[id]/members/[studentId]/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/sections/[id]/core-courses/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/sections/copy-to-year/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/students/[id]/move-section/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-6\",\n        \"TASK-7\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-9\",\n        \"FR-23\",\n        \"FR-24\",\n        \"NFR-7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n      \"description\": \"Course / enrollment / me API routes, thin 