nd rename its folder to the exact path listed.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"prisma/schema.prisma\",\n        \"prisma/migrations/20261027000000_classes_enrollment/migration.sql\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-1\",\n        \"NFR-2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Shared zod validators. sections.ts: sectionInputSchema (capacity int 1-60 default 30), sectionUpdateSchema (no academicYearId), enrollStudentsSchema ({studentIds min 1, overrideCapacity?}), moveSectionSchema, coreCoursesSchema (items min 1, unique subjectIds), copyToYearSchema, sections list query. courses.ts: courseInputSchema with ONE refinement 'sectionId required iff kind=CORE', coTeacherIds max 3, code uppercased transform; courseUpdateSchema (no academicYearId/sectionId/kind, plus archived?: boolean); enrollmentStatusSchema; courses list + roster query schemas. Client dialogs and API routes import the same schemas.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/lib/validators/sections.ts\",\n        \"src/lib/validators/courses.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-14\",\n        \"FR-23\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Roster Enrollment Engine (system-design component; tech-stack ADR-1/ADR-2). Every function takes a Prisma tx client first and never opens its own transaction: checkCapacityOrThrow(tx,{sectionId?|courseId?,addingCount,overrideCapacity}) -> AppError CONFLICT 'Section 7A is full (30/30).' / 'Course MATH-7A is full (30/30).'; enrollSectionCoreCourses (one findMany of existing pairs, one createMany skipDuplicates, one updateMany DROPPED->ACTIVE with droppedAt null; returns EnrollResult); dropSectionCoreCourses (updateMany ACTIVE->DROPPED, droppedAt now, CORE courses of that section only); moveStudentSection (drop then enroll). 