acity prompt on CONFLICT), 'Add students' UserPicker role=STUDENT multiple (POST /api/courses/:id/enrollments) — for CORE courses show an info Alert linking to the section and disable the picker.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment/EnrollmentClient.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-9\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-15\",\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"NFR-1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Course home: course-tabs.ts mirrors student-tabs.ts (key, label, href(courseId), roles) registering Overview (/courses/:id, all roles) and Roster (/courses/:id/roster, ADMIN/TEACHER/STUDENT; PARENT omitted). layout.tsx calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) + assertCanViewCourse, renders header (subject colour band, name, code, teacher + co-teachers, section, room) and CourseTabs.tsx (client, scrollable MUI Tabs filtered by role, active from usePathname). page.tsx = Overview (description, teachers, counts). roster/page.tsx calls getCourseRoster(courseId, user.role) and renders the full table for ADMIN/TEACHER or the names-only list for STUDENT; notFound/forbidden for PARENT.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/config/course-tabs.ts\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/layout.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/CourseTabs.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/roster/page.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-5\",\n        \"TASK-7\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-16\",\n        \"FR-17\",\n        \"FR-18\",\n        \"NFR-4\",\n        \"NFR-1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-16\",\n      \"description\": \"/my-courses page: server component calling courses-