{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B1MimxNto91b4Gfbd4hbQm","type":"tool_result","content":"159-The same applies to `Modal`.\n160-\n161:### [GridLegacy](#gridlegacy)\n162-\n163:The `GridLegacy` component is **removed**, use the `Grid` component instead.\n164-\n165-The main API differences are:\n166-\n167-- The `item` prop is no longer needed.\n168-- The `xs`, `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl` props are replaced by the `size` prop.\n169-\n170-```diff\n171:-import Grid from '@mui/material/GridLegacy';\n172:+import Grid from '@mui/material/Grid';\n173-\n174: <Grid container spacing={2}>\n175:-  <Grid item xs={12} sm={6}>\n176:+  <Grid size={{ xs: 12, sm: 6 }}>\n177-     ...\n178:   </Grid>\n179: </Grid>\n180-\n181-```\n182-\n183-CopyCopied(or C)\n184-\n185:See the [Grid v2 migration guide](/material-ui/migration/upgrade-to-grid-v2/) for more details.\n186-\n187:`MuiGridLegacy` has also been removed from the theme `components` types (`ComponentsProps`, `ComponentsOverrides`, and `ComponentsVariants`).\n188-\n189:### [Grid](#grid)\n190-\n191-#### `direction=\"column\"` and `direction=\"column-reverse\"` removed\n192-\n193:The `Grid` component no longer accepts `direction=\"column\"` or `direction=\"column-reverse\"`. These values were unsupported in practice in earlier versions and are now removed from the TypeScript types and prop validation.\n194-\n195:`Grid` is designed to subdivide a layout into **columns**, not rows. For vertical stacking, use the [Stack](/material-ui/react-stack/) component instead (including inside a `Grid` item when needed). See the [Grid column direction limitation](/material-ui/react-grid/#column-direction) for details.\n196-\n197-```diff\n198:-import Grid from '@mui/material/Grid';\n199-+import Stack from '@mui/material/Stack';\n200-\n201:-<Grid container direction=\"column\" spacing={2}>\n202:-  <Grid size={12}>First item</Grid>\n203:-  <Grid size={12}>Second item</Grid>\n204:-</Grid>\n205-+<Stack spacing={2}>\n206-+  <div>First item</div>\n207-+  <div>Second item</div>\n208-+</Stack>\n209-\n210-```\n211-\n212-CopyCopied(or C)\n213-\n214:If you still need horizontal column subdivision, keep using `Grid` with `direction=\"row\"` (the default) or `direction=\"row-reverse\"`.\n215-\n216-### [List](#list)\n217-\n218-The `ListItemIcon` default min-width has changed to `36px` (previously `56px`) to be consistent with the menu item, and now uses `theme.spacing` instead of a hardcoded number.\n219-\n220-### [Material Icons](#material-icons)\n221-\n222-23 legacy icon exports that ended with `Outline` (without the \"d\") have been removed. These were exact duplicates of their `Outlined` counterparts (for example, `InfoOutline` had the same SVG as `InfoOutlined`).\n223-\n224-To migrate, rename the import to use the `Outlined` suffix:\n225-\n226-```diff\n--\n603-   multiple\n604-   options={options}\n605:   renderInput={(params) => <TextField {...params} />}\n606--  ChipProps={{ size: 'small' }}\n607--  componentsProps={{\n608--    clearIndicator: { size: 'large' },\n609--    paper: { elevation: 2 },\n610--    popper: { placement: 'bottom-end' },\n611--    popupIndicator: { size: 'large' },\n612--  }}\n613--  ListboxComponent={CustomListbox}\n614--  ListboxProps={{ style: { maxHeight: 200 }, ref }}\n615--  PaperComponent={CustomPaper}\n616--  PopperComponent={(props) => {\n617--    const { disablePortal, anchorEl, open, ...other } = props;\n--\n984-The following deprecated `Checkbox` props have been removed:\n985-\n986:- `inputProps` — use `slotProps.input` instead\n987-- `inputRef` — use `slotProps.input.ref` instead\n988-\n989-```diff\n990- <Checkbox\n991:-  inputProps={{ 'aria-label': 'Checkbox' }}\n992--  inputRef={ref}\n993-+  slotProps={{ input: { 'aria-label': 'Checkbox', ref } }}\n994- />\n995-\n996-```\n997-\n998-CopyCopied(or C)\n999-\n1000-### [Chip CSS classes](#chip-css-classes)\n1001-\n1002-Use the [chip-classes codemod](https://github.com/mui/material-ui/tree/HEAD/packages/mui-codemod#chip-classes) below to migrate the code as described in the following section:\n1003-\n--\n1916-The following deprecated `Radio` props have been removed:\n1917-\n1918:- `inputProps` — use `slotProps.input` instead\n1919-- `inputRef` — use `slotProps.input.ref` instead\n1920-\n1921-```diff\n1922- <Radio\n1923:-  inputProps={{ 'aria-label': 'Radio' }}\n1924--  inputRef={ref}\n1925-+  slotProps={{ input: { 'aria-label': 'Radio', ref } }}\n1926- />\n1927-\n1928-```\n1929-","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a6e489fc-abc2-4cf6-8575-95ca4cd13810","uuid":"8c875b07-472f-4fab-92ad-a479c0731142","timestamp":"2026-10-27T16:47:16.019Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"159-The same applies to `Modal`.\n160-\n161:### [GridLegacy](#gridlegacy)\n162-\n163:The `GridLegacy` component is **removed**, use the `Grid` component instead.\n164-\n165-The main API differences are:\n166-\n167-- The `item` prop is no longer needed.\n168-- The `xs`, `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl` props are replaced by the `size` prop.\n169-\n170-```diff\n171:-import Grid from '@mui/material/GridLegacy';\n172:+import Grid from '@mui/material/Grid';\n173-\n174: <Grid container spacing={2}>\n175:-  <Grid item xs={12} sm={6}>\n176:+  <Grid size={{ xs: 12, sm: 6 }}>\n177-     ...\n178:   </Grid>\n179: </Grid>\n180-\n181-```\n182-\n183-CopyCopied(or C)\n184-\n185:See the [Grid v2 migration guide](/material-ui/migration/upgrade-to-grid-v2/) for more details.\n186-\n187:`MuiGridLegacy` has also been removed from the theme `components` types (`ComponentsProps`, `ComponentsOverrides`, and `ComponentsVariants`).\n188-\n189:### [Grid](#grid)\n190-\n191-#### `direction=\"column\"` and `direction=\"column-reverse\"` removed\n192-\n193:The `Grid` component no longer accepts `direction=\"column\"` or `direction=\"column-reverse\"`. These values were unsupported in practice in earlier versions and are now removed from the TypeScript types and prop validation.\n194-\n195:`Grid` is designed to subdivide 