equireRole(...); do NOT create permissions.ts/requireUser(). student-access.ts: replace the TEACHER branch of getAccessibleStudentIds with students ACTIVE in courses they teach/co-teach plus members of sections they are homeroom teacher of; signature unchanged.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/auth/course-access.ts\",\n        \"src/server/auth/student-access.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-18\",\n        \"FR-22\",\n        \"NFR-7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Sections service: listSections (year defaults to getCurrentAcademicYear; memberCount, courseCount, sort/q/page), getSection, createSection/updateSection (homeroom-teacher-once-per-year findFirst inside the write $transaction per Decision 3; capacity >= memberCount on update), deleteSection (CONFLICT if members or courses), listEligibleStudents(sectionId) (STUDENT, same grade level, no SectionMember this year — feeds the add picker), addMembers (tx: section capacity check, SectionMember createMany, map P2002 to friendly CONFLICT, enrollSectionCoreCourses), removeMember (tx: delete + dropSectionCoreCourses), moveStudent (one tx: remove + moveStudentSection; validates same year, different section), copySectionsToYear (structural Section copy, grade advanced by GradeLevel.order, top grade / name clashes reported in `skipped`, target must be future non-current year). All writes audit section.* / enrollment.*.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/sections/sections-service.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-2\",\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-2\",\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"FR-9\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-24\",\n        \"NFR-2\",\n    