chitect/system-design.md:211:              WHERE id IN (SELECT id FROM \"EmailOutbox\" WHERE status='PENDING' AND \"nextAttemptAt\"<=now()\nartifacts/architect/system-design.md:212:                           ORDER BY \"nextAttemptAt\" LIMIT ${batchSize} FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)\nartifacts/architect/system-design.md:216:                     err  → attempts+1, lastError=msg.slice(0,1000), nextRetry() →\n156:2. Retry schedule: attempts 1–5 back off at 1, 5, 15, 60 and 240 minutes; after the 5th failure set `FAILED`.\n210:- Unit: preference resolution, retry backoff calculation, link validation, `notifyStudentAndParents` expansion and dedupe.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GhfbEXRdy4GXwMZCWFXnqB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
