{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J7qtAK2cu5XGGjUvBGMhm2","type":"tool_result","content":"7:## [Why you should upgrade to Material UI v9](#why-you-should-upgrade-to-material-ui-v9)\n9:### [Improved accessibility and platform alignment](#improved-accessibility-and-platform-alignment)\n13:### [Quality-of-life improvements](#quality-of-life-improvements)\n18:- improved consistency across `slot` and `slotProps` APIs\n31:## [Supported browsers and versions](#supported-browsers-and-versions)\n41:## [Breaking changes](#breaking-changes)\n45:### [Autocomplete](#autocomplete)\n47:#### Listbox toggle on right click\n51:#### freeSolo type related changes\n92:### [Backdrop](#backdrop)\n96:### [ButtonBase](#buttonbase)\n98:#### Click event propagation from Enter and Spacebar\n104:#### Event handlers on disabled non-native buttons\n108:#### Replacing native button elements with non-interactive elements\n134:### [Dialog & Modal](#dialog-modal)\n136:The `disableEscapeKeyDown` prop has been removed. The same behavior could be achieved by checking the value of the `reason` argument in `onClose`:\n161:### [GridLegacy](#gridlegacy)\n163:The `GridLegacy` component is **removed**, use the `Grid` component instead.\n187:`MuiGridLegacy` has also been removed from the theme `components` types (`ComponentsProps`, `ComponentsOverrides`, and `ComponentsVariants`).\n189:### [Grid](#grid)\n191:#### `direction=\"column\"` and `direction=\"column-reverse\"` removed\n193:The `Grid` component no longer accepts `direction=\"column\"` or `direction=\"column-reverse\"`. These values were unsupported in practice in earlier versions and are now removed from the TypeScript types and prop validation.\n216:### [List](#list)\n220:### [Material Icons](#material-icons)\n222:23 legacy icon exports that ended with `Outline` (without the \"d\") have been removed. These were exact duplicates of their `Outlined` counterparts (for example, `InfoOutline` had the same SVG as `InfoOutlined`).\n234:The full list of removed exports: `AddCircleOutline`, `ChatBubbleOutline`, `CheckCircleOutline`, `DeleteOutline`, `DoneOutline`, `DriveFileMoveOutline`, `ErrorOutline`, `HelpOutline`, `InfoOutline`, `LabelImportantOutline`, `LightbulbOutline`, `LockOutline`, `MailOutline`, `ModeEditOutline`, `PauseCircleOutline`, `PeopleOutline`, `PersonOutline`, `PieChartOutline`, `PlayCircleOutline`, `RemoveCircleOutline`, `StarOutline`, `WorkOutline`, `WorkspacesOutline`.\n238:### [Menu and MenuList](#menu-and-menulist)\n254:### [Slider](#slider)\n258:### [Stepper, Step and StepButton](#stepper-step-and-stepbutton)\n281:### [TablePagination numbers are formatted by default](#tablepagination-numbers-are-formatted-by-default)\n326:### [Tabs](#tabs)\n334:### [TextField](#textfield)\n338:### [Theme](#theme)\n340:`MuiTouchRipple` has been removed from the theme `components` types (`ComponentsProps`, `ComponentsOverrides`, and `ComponentsVariants`). TouchRipple has been an internal component since v5 and never consumed theme overrides or default props, so the types were misleading.\n366:### [jsdom support](#jsdom-support)\n370:## [Deprecated APIs removed (Breaking)](#deprecated-apis-removed-breaking)\n372:APIs that were deprecated earlier have been removed in v9.\n374:### [Accordion props](#accordion-props)\n385:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `Accordion` component:\n388:- `TransitionProps` → use `slotProps.transition`\n395:+  slotProps={{ transition: { unmountOnExit: true } }}\n402:### [AccordionSummary CSS classes](#accordionsummary-css-classes)\n413:The deprecated `AccordionSummary` CSS class `contentGutters` has been removed. Use the combination of `.MuiAccordionSummary-gutters` and `.MuiAccordionSummary-content` classes instead:\n425:### [Alert CSS classes](#alert-css-classes)\n436:The following deprecated `Alert` CSS classes have been removed:\n495:### [Alert props](#alert-props)\n506:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `Alert` component:\n509:- `componentsProps` → use `slotProps`\n517:+  slotProps={{ closeButton: { size: 'large' }, closeIcon: { fontSize: 'small' } }}\n524:### [Avatar props](#avatar-props)\n535:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `Avatar` component:\n537:- `imgProps` → use `slotProps.img`\n541:+<Avatar slotProps={{ img: { crossOrigin: 'anonymous', referrerPolicy: 'no-referrer' } }} />\n547:### [AvatarGroup props](#avatargroup-props)\n558:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `AvatarGroup` component:\n560:- `componentsProps` → use `slotProps` (the `additionalAvatar` key has been renamed to `surplus`)\n564:+<AvatarGroup slotProps={{ surplus: { className: 'my-class' } }}>\n570:If you were already using the `surplus` key via `componentsProps`, move it to `slotProps`:\n574:+<AvatarGroup slotProps={{ surplus: { className: 'my-class' } }}>\n580:### [Autocomplete props](#autocomplete-props)\n591:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `Autocomplete` component:\n593:- `ChipProps` → use `slotProps.chip`\n594:- `componentsProps` → use `slotProps`\n596:- `ListboxProps` → use `slotProps.listbox`\n633:+  slotProps={{\n654:### [useAutocomplete fields](#useautocomplete-fields)\n665:The following deprecated members have been removed from the `useAutocomplete` hook return value:\n670:#### getTagProps\n686:#### focusedTag\n698:### [Backdrop props](#backdrop-props)\n709:The following deprecated `Backdrop` props have been removed:\n712:- `componentsProps` — use `slotProps` instead\n721:+  slotProps={{ root: { className: 'my-class' } }}\n727:### [Badge props](#badge-props)\n738:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `Badge` component:\n741:- `componentsProps` → use `slotProps`\n748:+  slotProps={{ root: { className: 'my-root' }, badge: { className: 'my-badge' } }}\n755:### [Button CSS classes](#button-css-classes)\n766:The following deprecated `Button` CSS classes have been removed:\n888:### [ButtonGroup CSS classes](#buttongroup-css-classes)\n899:The following deprecated `ButtonGroup` CSS classes have been removed:\n946:### [CardHeader props](#cardheader-props)\n957:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `CardHeader` component:\n959:- `titleTypographyProps` → use `slotProps.title`\n960:- `subheaderTypographyProps` → use `slotProps.subheader`\n966:+  slotProps={{ title: { className: 'my-title' }, subheader: { className: 'my-subheader' } }}\n973:### [Checkbox props](#checkbox-props)\n984:The following deprecated `Checkbox` props have been removed:\n986:- `inputProps` — use `slotProps.input` instead\n987:- `inputRef` — use `slotProps.input.ref` instead\n993:+  slotProps={{ input: { 'aria-label': 'Checkbox', ref } }}\n1000:### [Chip CSS classes](#chip-css-classes)\n1011:The following deprecated `Chip` CSS classes have been removed:\n1078:### [CircularProgress CSS classes](#circularprogress-css-classes)\n1089:The following deprecated `CircularProgress` CSS classes have been removed:\n1124:### [Dialog CSS classes](#dialog-css-classes)\n1135:The following deprecated `Dialog` CSS classes have been removed:\n1178:### [Dialog props](#dialog-props)\n1189:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `Dialog` component:\n1192:- `BackdropProps` → use `slotProps.backdrop`\n1193:- `PaperProps` → use `slotProps.paper`\n1195:- `TransitionProps` → use `slotProps.transition`\n1205:+  slotProps={{ backdrop: { invisible: true }, paper: { elevation: 3 }, transition: { timeout: 500 } }}\n1212:### [Drawer props](#drawer-props)\n1223:The following deprecated props have been removed from the `Drawer` component:\n1226:- `BackdropProps` → use `slotProps.backdrop`\n1227:- `PaperProps` → use `slotProps.paper`\n1228:- `SlideProps` → use `slotProps.transition`\n1239:+  slotProps={{ backdrop: { invisible: true }, paper: { elevation: 2 }, transition: { timeout: 500 } }}\n1246:### [Drawer CSS classes](#drawer-css-classes)\n1257:The following deprecated classes have been removed:\n1279:### [Divider props](#divider-props)\n1290:The deprecated `Divider` prop has been removed. Use `sx={{ opacity: 0.6 }}` (or any opacity):\n1302:### [Divider CSS classes](#divider-css-classes)\n1304:The following deprecated class has been removed:\n1316:### [FormControlLabel props](#formcontrollabel-props)\n1327:The following deprecated prop has been removed:\n1329:- `componentsProps` — use `slotProps` instead\n1334:+  slotProps={{ typography: { fontWeight: 'bold' } }}\n1341:### [FilledInput props](#filledinput-props)\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 120]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1921163e-32be-4c5c-99f3-b230ef406493","uuid":"11d9c7e2-fd7f-499a-816f-a7242b8b6605","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:01:52.000Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"7:## [Why you should upgrade to Material UI v9](#why-you-should-upgrade-to-material-ui-v9)\n9:### [Improved accessibility and platform alignment](#improved-accessibility-and-platform-alignment)\n13:### [Quality-of-life improvements](#quality-of-life-improvements)\n18:- improved consistency across `slot` and `slotProps` APIs\n31:## [Supported browsers and versions](#supported-browsers-and-versions)\n41:## [Breaking changes](#breaking-changes)\n45:### [Autocomplete](#autocomplete)\n47:#### Listbox toggle on right click\n51:#### freeSolo type related changes\n92:### [Backdrop](#backdrop)\n96:### [ButtonBase](#buttonbase)\n98:#### Click event propagation from Enter and Spacebar\n104:#### Event handlers on disabled non-native buttons\n108:#### Replacing native button elements with non-interactive elements\n134:### [Dialog & Modal](#dialog-modal)\n136:The `disableEscapeKeyDown` prop has been removed. The same behavior could be achieved by checking the value of the `reason` argument in `onClose`:\n161:### [GridLegacy](#gridlegacy)\n163:The `GridLegacy` component is **removed**, use the `Grid` component instead.\n187:`MuiGridLegacy` has also been removed f