{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FHtjpMpfJ8qXaHmhgRjirK","type":"tool_result","content":"2610\t\n2611\tCopyCopied(or C)\n2612\t\n2613\tThe following deprecated props have been removed from the `Tooltip` component:\n2614\t\n2615\t- `components` → use `slots`\n2616\t- `componentsProps` → use `slotProps`\n2617\t- `PopperComponent` → use `slots.popper`\n2618\t- `PopperProps` → use `slotProps.popper`\n2619\t- `TransitionComponent` → use `slots.transition`\n2620\t- `TransitionProps` → use `slotProps.transition`\n2621\t\n2622\t```diff\n2623\t <Tooltip\n2624\t   title=\"Hello World\"\n2625\t-  components={{ Popper: CustomPopper, Tooltip: CustomTooltip, Transition: CustomTransition, Arrow: CustomArrow }}\n2626\t-  componentsProps={{ popper: { placement: 'top' }, tooltip: { className: 'custom' }, arrow: { className: 'arrow' } }}\n2627\t-  PopperComponent={CustomPopper}\n2628\t-  PopperProps={{ disablePortal: true }}\n2629\t-  TransitionComponent={CustomTransition}\n2630\t-  TransitionProps={{ timeout: 500 }}\n2631\t+  slots={{ popper: CustomPopper, tooltip: CustomTooltip, transition: CustomTransition, arrow: CustomArrow }}\n2632\t+  slotProps={{\n2633\t+    popper: { placement: 'top', disablePortal: true },\n2634\t+    tooltip: { className: 'custom' },\n2635\t+    transition: { timeout: 500 },\n2636\t+    arrow: { className: 'arrow' },\n2637\t+  }}\n2638\t />\n2639\t\n2640\t```\n2641\t\n2642\tCopyCopied(or C)\n2643\t\n2644\t### [Typography CSS classes](#typography-css-classes)\n2645\t\n2646\tThe deprecated `paragraph` CSS class has been removed. Use CSS `.MuiTypography-root:where(p)` to apply custom styles for the paragraph element instead:\n2647\t\n2648\t```diff\n2649\t-.MuiTypography-paragraph {\n2650\t-  margin-bottom: 16px;\n2651\t-}\n2652\t+.MuiTypography-root:where(p) {\n2653\t+  margin-bottom: 16px;\n2654\t+}\n2655\t\n2656\t```\n2657\t\n2658\tCopyCopied(or C)\n2659\t\n2660\t### [Typography props](#typography-props)\n2661\t\n2662\tUse the [typography-props codemod](https://github.com/mui/material-ui/tree/HEAD/packages/mui-codemod#typography-props) below to migrate the code as described in the following section:\n2663\t\n2664\t```bash\n2665\tnpx @mui/codemod@latest deprecations/typography-props <path>\n2666\t\n2667\t```\n2668\t\n2669\tCopyCopied(or C)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1921163e-32be-4c5c-99f3-b230ef406493","uuid":"feed9f96-de21-4bde-ac2c-e01b666287ff","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:02:10.634Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/.claude/projects/-Users-ikramaansari-Documents-forge-schoolhub-prds/1921163e-32be-4c5c-99f3-b230ef406493/tool-results/mcp-mui-mcp-fetchDocs-1793804508479.txt","content":"\nCopyCopied(or C)\n\nThe following deprecated props have been removed from the `Tooltip` component:\n\n- `components` → use `slots`\n- `componentsProps` → use `slotProps`\n- `PopperComponent` → use `slots.popper`\n- `PopperProps` → use `slotProps.popper`\n- `TransitionComponent` → use `slots.transition`\n- `TransitionProps` → use `slotProps.transition`\n\n```diff\n <Tooltip\n   title=\"Hello World\"\n-  components={{ Popper: CustomPopper, Tooltip: CustomTooltip, Transition: CustomTransition, Arrow: CustomArrow }}\n-  componentsProps={{ popper: { placement: 'top' }, tooltip: { className: 'custom' }, arrow: { className: 'arrow' } }}\n-  PopperComponent={CustomPopper}\n-  PopperProps={{ disablePortal: true }}\n-  TransitionComponent={CustomTransition}\n-  TransitionProps={{ timeout: 500 }}\n+  slots={{ popper: CustomPopper, tooltip: CustomTooltip, transition: CustomTransition, arrow: CustomArrow }}\n+  slotProps={{\n+    popper: { placement: 'top', disablePortal: true },\n+    tooltip: { className: 'custom' },\n+    transition: { timeout: 500 },\n+    arrow: { className: 'arrow' },\n+  }}\n />\n\n```\n\nCopyCopied(or C)\n\n### [Typography CSS classes](#typography-css-classes)\n\nThe deprecated `paragraph` CSS class has been removed. Use CSS `.