t element if size=\"small\".                                      |\n\n\nYou can override the style of the component using one of these customization options:\n\n- With a [global class name](/material-ui/integrations/interoperability/#global-css).\n- With a rule name as part of the component's [styleOverrides property](/material-ui/customization/theme-components/#theme-style-overrides) in a custom theme.\n\n## [Source code](#source-code)\n\nIf you did not find the information in this page, consider having a look at the [implementation of the component](https://github.com/mui/material-ui/blob/v9.5.0/packages/mui-material/src/Switch/Switch.js) for more detail."}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KXkUHBtaxeAui8F79LTibH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
