ve), a conflicting drop shows the error snackbar, and Sam's /timetable Today view shows Now/Next. Finish by running npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run test\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/timetable.spec.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-11\",\n        \"TASK-12\",\n        \"TASK-14\",\n        \"TASK-15\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"NFR-1\",\n        \"NFR-10\",\n        \"NFR-12\",\n        \"NFR-13\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"fileStructure\": {\n    \"prisma/\": [\n      \"schema.prisma\",\n      \"seed.ts\",\n      \"seed-timetable-week.ts\",\n      \"migrations/20261105000000_timetable/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/lib/\": [\n      \"dates.ts\",\n      \"validators/timetable.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"src/server/timetable/\": [\n      \"clash-rules.ts\",\n      \"timetable-service.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"src/app/api/\": [\n      \"periods/\",\n      \"school-days/\",\n      \"timetable/\",\n      \"me/timetable/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/app/(app)/\": [\n      \"shell.tsx\",\n      \"admin/timetable/\",\n      \"timetable/\",\n      \"students/[id]/timetable/\",\n      \"courses/[courseId]/schedule/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/components/\": [\n      \"TimetableGrid/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/config/\": [\n      \"navigation.ts\",\n      \"student-tabs.ts\",\n      \"course-tabs.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"tests/\": [\n      \"unit/\",\n      \"integration/\",\n      \"e2e/\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"totalEstimateHours\": 44,\n  \"nxpPatterns\": [],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Path corrections vs system-design §6: courses/[courseId]/schedule (the route segment is [courseId]); the app shell is src/app/(app)/shell.tsx; the seed week constant moves to prisma/seed-timetable-week.ts because seed.ts runs main() on import; periodsOverlap is a pure helper in clash-rules.ts.\",\n    \"timetable-service.ts is owned by TASK-5 (CREATE, write side) and TASK-6 (MODIFY, rea