"NFR-15\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"Create thin route handlers for the bell schedule (withHandler → requireUser/requireRole → parseBody/parseQuery → service → ok()) per api-contracts.json: GET (any user)/POST (ADMIN) /api/periods, PATCH/DELETE /api/periods/[id], POST /api/periods/reorder, GET (any user)/PUT (ADMIN) /api/school-days. Pass request to audit for the IP\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/periods/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/periods/[id]/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/periods/reorder/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/school-days/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-5\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-33\",\n        \"FR-34\",\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"NFR-7\",\n        \"NFR-8\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"Create thin timetable route handlers per api-contracts.json: GET /api/timetable (requireUser + assertCanViewTimetable), GET /api/timetable/availability (ADMIN), GET /api/timetable/free-rooms (ADMIN), POST /api/timetable/slots (ADMIN, 201), PATCH/DELETE /api/timetable/slots/[id] (ADMIN), GET /api/me/timetable (TEACHER own; STUDENT self only; PARENT studentId required when >1 children, defaults to the only child, assertCanViewStudent; ADMIN → { slots: [] })\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/timetable/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/timetable/availability/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/timetable/free-rooms/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/timetable/slots/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/timetable/slots/[id]/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/me/timetable/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-6\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-21\",\n        \"FR-25\",\n        \"FR-35\",\n        \"FR-36\",\n        \"FR-37\",\n        \"FR-38\",\n        \"NFR-7\",\n        \"NFR-8\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the shared src/components/TimetableGrid/ component (first look up every MUI component via mui-mcp useMuiDocs → fetchDocs; stop if it is unreachable). It is a CSS-grid Box with teaching-day columns and period rows; non-CLASS rows span the full width, are greyed and are not droppable. Cells are focusable Paper elements with aria-labels and subject colour + getContrastText + room Chip. mode read|edit: useDroppable/useDraggable only in edit mode, no DndContext. Clash tint uses error.light + ErrorOutline icon + Tooltip. Highlight uses an outline + a 'Now' Chip. Callbacks: onCellActivate/onSlotActivate/onSlotDelete (Enter/Delete keys). Also TimetablePrintStyles (GlobalStyles @page A4 landscape, hide [data-print=hide], show .print-only), PrintButton (window.print) and an index.ts barrel\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/components/TimetableGrid/TimetableGrid.tsx\",\n        \"src/components/TimetableGrid/TimetablePrintStyles.tsx\",\n        \"src/components/TimetableGrid/PrintButton.tsx\",\n        \"src/components/TimetableGrid/index.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\",\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-16\",\n        \"FR-19\",\n        \"FR-22\",\n        \"FR-23\",\n        \"FR-24\",\n        \"FR-29\",\n        \"NFR-4\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-16\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-10\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the bell schedule page /admin/timetable/periods (requirePageRole('ADMIN'), PageHeader) and the client BellScheduleEditor: an MUI Table of periods with up/down IconButton reorder, an add/edit Dialog with TimeField (HH:mm format/parse) validated by periodSchema, and delete via ConfirmDialog (a 409 → showToast with the slot count). It also has a Teaching days section of 7 ToggleButtons; switching off a day with slotCount>0 → ConfirmDialog 'Remove N slots on <Day>?' → PUT /api/school-days. Use mui-mcp before writing any MUI component\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/timetable/periods/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/timetable/periods/BellScheduleEditor.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-7\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-9\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-11\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the timetable editor /admin/timetable (requirePageRole('ADMIN')) and the client TimetableEditor. URL state is ?view=section|teacher|room&id=&year=. It has a view ToggleButtonGroup, an entity Autocomplete (sections / UserPicker TEACHER / rooms) and a year Select. Section view: DndContext(PointerSensor distance 5) with a sidebar of draggable non-archived course Cards with a 'placed N' Chip, the grid in edit mode, and a DragOverlay. On drag start, load the availability clash map (cache key courseId:roomId). Drop → POST (roomId = section.roomId) or PATCH. Pessimistic: refetch on 2xx; on 409 showToast with every details.clashes message. Drop outside or Delete → ConfirmDialog → DELETE. Slot click → Popover + Autocomplete of free-rooms → PATCH { roomId }. Enter on an empty cell → 'Place course' Dialog. Teacher and room views are read-only. Includes the PrintButton\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/timetable/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/timetable/TimetableEditor.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-8\",\n        \"TASK-9\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 6,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-15\",\n        \"FR-16\",\n        \"FR-17\",\n        \"FR-18\",\n        \"FR-19\",\n        \"FR-20\",\n        \"FR-21\",\n        \"FR-22\",\n        \"FR-23\",\n        \"FR-29\",\n        \"NFR-4\",\n        \"NFR-5\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the personal timetable /timetable (requirePageRole TEACHER/STUDENT/PARENT). The server resolves the target (PARENT ?studentId= must be a linked child) and passes getPersonalTimetable, the school tz and the now ISO string to the client PersonalTimetable. The client has a Week/Today ToggleButtonGroup, a PARENT child Select when there are >1 children, a read grid with highlight via schoolNow, a Today List with 'Now'/'Next' Chips via nowAndNext, a 60 s interval that advances now, and a PrintButton. Also create the student tab page students/[id]/timetable (requirePageUser + assertCanViewStudent, read grid) and register { key: 'timetable', label: 'Timetable' } in student-tabs.ts\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/timetable/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/timetable/PersonalTimetable.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/students/[id]/timetable/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/config/student-tabs.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-8\",\n        \"TASK-9\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-24\",\n        \"FR-25\",\n        \"FR-26\",\n        \"FR-27\",\n        \"FR-29\",\n        \"FR-45\",\n        \"NFR-4\",\n        \"NFR-7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the course Schedule tab page src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/schedule/page.tsx (requirePageUser + assertCanViewCourse; MUI Table with day, period, start–end and room from timetableSlot.findMany({ courseId }) ordered by day then period.order) and register { key: 'schedule', label: 'Schedule' } in course-tabs.ts. The route segment is [courseId], not [id]\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/schedule/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/config/course-tabs.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-28\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"Add the navigation entries in src/config/navigation.ts: 'Timetable' /timetable (TEACHER, STUDENT, PARENT), plus 'Timetable editor' /admin/timetable and 'Bell schedule' /admin/timetable/periods (ADMIN, group 'Administration'). Add data-print=\\\"hide\\\" to the AppBar and both Drawers in src/app/(app)/shell.tsx so that print output contains only the grid\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/config/navigation.ts\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/shell.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-10\",\n        \"TASK-11\",\n        \"TASK-12\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-32\",\n        \"FR-29\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Seed. Create the pure constant prisma/seed-timetable-week.ts: 21 class slots per section for 7A and 7B (MATH 5, ENG 5, SCI 4, HIST 3, PE 2, ART 2), plus ROBOTICS on Wed (3) P6 with 7A and 7B free, and MATH-7A/7B never in the same cell. Extend prisma/seed.ts with idempotent seedPeriods (FR-41 times, order 1–8, Break order 3, Lunch order 6), seedSchoolDays (Mon–Fri teaching) and seedTimetableFixtures (upsert Tom, a second teacher, Sam + sibling in 7A, Pat linked to both, sections 7A/7B with Room 101/102 homerooms, courses with ENG→ELA and HIST→SOC, ROBOTICS elective sectionId null, ACTIVE enrollments; reuse an existing fixture seed if one is present). Add seedTimetableWeek, which upserts on courseId_dayOfWeek_periodId. Add tests/unit/timetable-seed.test.ts: zero clashesForCell clashes, 21 slots per section, Robotics on Wed P6\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"prisma/seed-timetable-week.ts\",\n        \"prisma/seed.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/timetable-seed.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-4\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-41\",\n        \"FR-42\",\n        \"FR-43\",\n        \"FR-44\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-16\",\n      \"description\": \"Add tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts (describe.runIf(TEST_DATABASE_URL), the same pattern as email-dispatch.test.ts): Promise.allSettled of two conflicting createSlot calls → exactly one fulfilled. Add tests/e2e/timetable.spec.ts: ADMIN drags a course into a cell (stepwise mouse.move), a conflicting drop shows the error snackbar, and Sam's /timetable Today view shows Now/Next. Finish by running npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run test\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/timetable.spec.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-11\",\n        \"TASK-12\",\n        \"TASK-14\",\n        \"TASK-15\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"NFR-1\",\n        \"NFR-10\",\n        \"NFR-12\",\n        \"NFR-13\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"fileStructure\": {\n    \"prisma/\": [\n      \"schema.prisma\",\n      \"seed.ts\",\n      \"seed-timetable-week.ts\",\n      \"migrations/20261105000000_timetable/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/lib/\": [\n      \"dates.ts\",\n      \"validators/timetable.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"src/server/timetable/\": [\n      \"clash-rules.ts\",\n      \"timetable-service.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"src/app/api/\": [\n      \"periods/\",\n      \"school-days/\",\n      \"timetable/\",\n      \"me/timetable/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/app/(app)/\": [\n      \"shell.tsx\",\n      \"admin/timetable/\",\n      \"timetable/\",\n      \"students/[id]/timetable/\",\n      \"courses/[courseId]/schedule/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/components/\": [\n      \"TimetableGrid/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/config/\": [\n      \"navigation.ts\",\n      \"student-tabs.ts\",\n      \"course-tabs.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"tests/\": [\n      \"unit/\",\n      \"integration/\",\n      \"e2e/\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"totalEstimateHours\": 44,\n  \"nxpPatterns\": [],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Path corrections vs system-design §6: courses/[courseId]/schedule (the route segment is [courseId]); the app shell is src/app/(app)/shell.tsx; the seed week constant moves to prisma/seed-timetable-week.ts because seed.ts runs main() on import; periodsOverlap is a pure helper in clash-rules.ts.\",\n    \"timetable-service.ts is owned by TASK-5 (CREATE, write side) and TASK-6 (MODIFY, read side) so that the dev continuation loop can track partial progress.\",\n    \"NFR-5 hard gate: before writing any UI in TASK-9..13, dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs) is reachable. If it is not, stop and report.\",\n    \"The previous dev-planning artifacts on disk were for SH-4 and have been replaced.\"\n  ],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01W1MAopThe6gdw15qsvStVn","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
