{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LarJVH26Y1LwmzULFxruhN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Add @@index([role, status]) to User in schema.prisma and an additive migration with one CREATE INDEX (via prisma migrate dev --create-only). Keep AuditLog.ip \\u2014 no rename.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"prisma/schema.prisma\",\n        \"prisma/migrations/20261106000000_user_role_status_index/migration.sql\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-1\",\n        \"FR-32\",\n        \"FR-33\",\n        \"NFR-13\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Seed: before the PRD-04 notifications block, upsert six ACTIVE users (bcrypt.hash('SchoolHub123!',12) once, update:{}) and invited@schoolhub.test (Ivy Invited, TEACHER, INVITED, passwordHash null). While still INVITED, createInviteToken + logger.info({link: authLink('invite', raw)}). Never call sendAuthEmail. New lines use logger.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"prisma/seed.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-28\",\n        \"FR-29\",\n        \"FR-30\",\n        \"FR-31\",\n        \"FR-22\",\n        \"NFR-12\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"/login: server page reads searchParams.callbackUrl and reset, then renders client LoginForm (RHF + zodResolver(signInSchema), email/password with passwordInputSlot, aria-live Alert, link to /forgot-password, no sign-up link). signIn('credentials',{redirect:false}). Export pure loginErrorMessage(code) for locked:N/disabled/rate_limited/default. On success router.replace(safeCallbackUrl(cb)) + refresh. reset=1 shows a useToast success toast. Look up MUI components via mui-mcp first (NFR-6 gate).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(auth)/login/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(auth)/login/LoginForm.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-2\",\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-19\",\n        \"NFR-2\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-6\",\n        \"NFR-7\",\n        \"NFR-11\",\n        \"NFR-14\",\n        \"NFR-15\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Unit test loginErrorMessage: locked:7, disabled, rate_limited, invalid, unknown/undefined.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/unit/login-error-message.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 0.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-34\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"/forgot-password client page: RHF + forgotPasswordSchema, postJson('/api/auth/forgot-password'). On 2xx or RATE_LIMITED, replace the form with a success Alert showing RESET_REQUESTED_MESSAGE (no enumeration). Show only VALIDATION_ERROR inline. Link to /login.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(auth)/forgot-password/page.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-17\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-6\",\n        \"NFR-7\",\n        \"NFR-11\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"/reset-password/[token]: server page runs verifyToken(token,'PASSWORD_RESET'). Null shows the invalid-link Alert + /forgot-password link. Otherwise render client ResetClient with SetPasswordForm(email). It posts {token,password,confirm} to /api/auth/reset-password; success goes to router.replace('/login?reset=1'); INVALID_TOKEN (410) shows the invalid Alert. Never log the token.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(auth)/reset-password/[token]/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(auth)/reset-password/[token]/ResetClient.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-16\",\n        \"FR-19\",\n        \"NFR-1\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-6\",\n        \"NFR-8\",\n        \"NFR-11\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"/invite/[token]: server page runs verifyToken(token,'INVITE'). Null shows the FR-13 Alert copy (page-owned). Valid renders client InviteClient with SetPasswordForm (read-only name + email, submitLabel 'Activate account'). It posts {token,password,confirm} to /api/auth/accept-invite, then signIn('credentials',{redirect:false}), then router.replace('/dashboard'). INVALID_TOKEN shows the FR-13 Alert.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(auth)/invite/[token]/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(auth)/invite/[token]/InviteClient.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-12\",\n        \"FR-13\",\n        \"FR-14\",\n        \"FR-15\",\n        \"FR-16\",\n        \"NFR-1\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-6\",\n        \"NFR-8\",\n        \"NFR-11\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"App shell: (app)/layout.tsx calls requirePageUser() and passes user={id,firstName,lastName,role} to AppShell (keep schoolSettings). shell.tsx: delete PLACEHOLDER_USER, add the user prop, navigationForRole(user.role), UserAvatar initials, name + role Chip in the menu header, 'Account security' MenuItem (Link to /account/security), and 'Sign out' as signOut({redirectTo:'/login'}). Afterwards, grep PLACEHOLDER_USER src must return nothing.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/layout.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/shell.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-21\",\n        \"FR-23\",\n        \"FR-25\",\n        \"FR-26\",\n        \"FR-27\",\n        \"NFR-6\",\n        \"NFR-7\",\n        \"NFR-9\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n      \"description\": \"/account/security: server page calls requirePageUser() and renders client ChangePasswordForm(email) (RHF + changePasswordFormSchema(email), current/new/confirm fields with passwordInputSlot, PasswordChecklist under new). It posts to /api/account/password and remaps fieldErrors.password to newPassword before applyFieldErrors. Success shows the useToast 'Password updated' and reset().\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/account/security/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/account/security/ChangePasswordForm.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-8\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-16\",\n        \"FR-20\",\n        \"FR-23\",\n        \"NFR-5\",\n        \"NFR-6\",\n        \"NFR-7\",\n        \"NFR-9\",\n        \"NFR-11\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-10\",\n      \"description\": \"Integration test for authorizeCredentials (TEST_DATABASE_URL-gated, @vitest-environment node, __resetRateLimits in beforeEach). Covers unknown email, wrong password, disabled, archived, locked:N, 5th failure \\u2192 lockout + auth.lockout audit, rate limit, and success \\u2192 count reset + lastLoginAt + auth.login.success.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/integration/auth-authorize.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"FR-34\",\n        \"NFR-3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-11\",\n      \"description\": \"Integration tests. accept-invite: happy path \\u2192 ACTIVE, passwordChangedAt set, token consumed, auth.invite.accepted; reuse \\u2192 INVALID_TOKEN; policy violation (password123). reset-password: unknown email creates no token; ACTIVE user gets a token + EmailOutbox row; older tokens invalidated; reset clears lockout, consumes the token and audits.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/integration/auth-accept-invite.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/integration/auth-reset-password.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-13\",\n        \"FR-14\",\n        \"FR-15\",\n        \"FR-17\",\n        \"FR-18\",\n        \"FR-19\",\n        \"FR-34\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"Integration test changePassword: a wrong current password returns fieldErrors.currentPassword; success updates the hash and passwordChangedAt.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/integration/auth-change-password.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-20\",\n        \"FR-10\",\n        \"FR-34\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"Extract the CSRF + /api/auth/callback/credentials cookie sign-in from notifications.spec.ts into signInAs(page,email,password). Use it with the seed admin in dashboard.spec.ts before visiting /dashboard (R1 regression fix). Leave notifications.spec.ts unchanged.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/e2e/helpers/auth.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/dashboard.spec.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-2\",\n        \"TASK-8\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-34\",\n        \"NFR-13\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"Playwright auth.spec (mode serial): UI sign-in as admin \\u2192 /dashboard with the real name in the menu; sign out \\u2192 /login; wrong-password message; unauth /dashboard \\u2192 /login?callbackUrl=%2Fdashboard; forgot \\u2192 reset for student2@ (newest EmailOutbox row via @prisma/client), then sign in with the new password, restoring it in afterAll; one AxeBuilder run on /login.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/e2e/auth.spec.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-2\",\n        \"TASK-3\",\n        \"TASK-5\",\n        \"TASK-6\",\n        \"TASK-8\",\n        \"TASK-13\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-2\",\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-17\",\n        \"FR-19\",\n        \"FR-26\",\n        \"FR-34\",\n        \"NFR-5\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"fileStructure\": {\n    \"prisma/\": [\n      \"schema.prisma\",\n      \"seed.ts\",\n      \"migrations/20261106000000_user_role_status_index/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/app/(auth)/\": [\n      \"login/\",\n      \"forgot-password/\",\n      \"reset-password/[token]/\",\n      \"invite/[token]/\"\n    ],\n    \"src/app/(app)/\": [\n      \"layout.tsx\",\n      \"shell.tsx\",\n      \"account/security/\"\n    ],\n    \"tests/unit/\": [\n      \"login-error-message.test.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"tests/integration/\": [\n      \"auth-authorize.test.ts\",\n      \"auth-accept-invite.test.ts\",\n      \"auth-reset-password.test.ts\",\n      \"auth-change-password.test.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"tests/e2e/\": [\n      \"helpers/\",\n      \"auth.spec.ts\",\n      \"dashboard.spec.ts\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"totalEstimateHours\": 25.5,\n  \"nxpPatterns\": [],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"prisma/schema.prisma\",\n      \"taskId\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"operation\": \"MODIFY\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"prisma/migrations/20261106000000_user_role_status_index/migration.sql\",\n      \"