{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JrcERMffUQ6ED3fpUjALzQ","type":"tool_result","content":"92 policy \\u2192 bcrypt 12 \\u2192 transaction(consume token, set hash, status=ACTIVE, passwordChangedAt=now) \\u2192 audit auth.invite.accepted. Does NOT create a session: the client then calls signIn('credentials') with the returned email and the password just set, and goes to /dashboard. On 410 the PAGE renders the FR-13 copy ('This invitation link is invalid or has expired. Ask the school office to send a new one.'), not the service message.\",\n   \"auth\": \"public (token-gated)\",\n   \"requestSchema\": {\n    \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n    \"zod\": \"acceptInviteSchema\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"required\": [\n     \"token\",\n     \"password\",\n     \"confirm\"\n    ],\n    \"properties\": {\n     \"token\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1\n     },\n     \"password\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\"\n     },\n     \"confirm\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n     }\n    }\n   },\n   \"responseSchema\": {\n    \"200\": {\n     \"data\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\n       \"email\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n       \"email\": {\n        \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Email\"\n       }\n      }\n     }\n    },\n    \"400\": {\n     \"error\": {\n      \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n      \"details\": {\n       \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\"\n      }\n     }\n    },\n    \"410\": {\n     \"error\": {\n      \"code\": \"INVALID_TOKEN\",\n      \"message\": \"This link is invalid or has expired.\"\n     }\n    }\n   },\n   \"requirementIds\": [\n    \"FR-12\",\n    \"FR-13\",\n    \"FR-14\",\n    \"FR-15\",\n    \"NFR-1\",\n    \"NFR-8\",\n    \"NFR-10\",\n    \"NFR-14\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"method\": \"POST\",\n   \"path\": \"/api/account/password\",\n   \"description\": \"Signed-in password change (C5 /account/security). requireUser \\u2192 changePasswordSchema \\u2192 bcrypt compare current \\u2192 policy \\u2192 update hash + passwordChangedAt \\u2192 audit auth.password.changed \\u2192 unstable_update({ reauth: true }) re-issues THIS session so only other sessions are revoked (within 5 min). Success \\u2192 useToast 'Password updated'.\",\n   \"auth\": \"session required (requireUser; middleware returns 401 UNAUTHENTICATED JSON without a session)\",\n   \"requestSchema\": {\n    \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n    \"zod\": \"changePasswordSchema\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"required\": [\n     \"currentPassword\",\n     \"newPassword\",\n     \"confirm\"\n    ],\n    \"properties\": {\n     \"currentPassword\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1\n     },\n     \"newPassword\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\"\n     },\n     \"confirm\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n     }\n    }\n   },\n   \"responseSchema\": {\n    \"200\": {\n     \"data\": {\n      \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Ok\"\n     }\n    },\n    \"400\": {\n     \"error\": {\n      \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n      \"details\": {\n       \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\"\n      }\n     },\n     \"cases\": {\n      \"wrongCurrent\": \"{ message: 'Current password is incorrect.', details: { fieldErrors: { currentPassword: ['Current password is incorrect.'] } } }\",\n      \"policyFailure\": \"details.fieldErrors.password (NOT newPassword) \\u2014 assertPasswordAllowed hard-codes the `password` key. ChangePasswordForm must remap password \\u2192 newPassword before applyFieldErrors(), or the error renders nowhere. Client-side Zod already catches all rules except common-password, so this case only appears for common passwords.\"\n     }\n    },\n    \"401\": {\n     \"error\": {\n      \"code\": \"UNAUTHENTICATED\"\n     }\n    }\n   },\n   \"requirementIds\": [\n    \"FR-10\",\n    \"FR-15\",\n    \"FR-20\",\n    \"FR-23\",\n    \"NFR-9\",\n    \"NFR-10\",\n    \"NFR-11\"\n   ]\n  }\n ],\n \"unauthenticatedBehaviour\": {\n  \"description\": \"middleware.ts (existing): unauthenticated /api/* requests other than /api/health, /api/auth/* and public-routes.ts paths return 401 { error: { code: 'UNAUTHENTICATED' } }; unauthenticated (app) page requests redirect to /login?callbackUrl=<path>.\",\n  \"requirementIds\": [\n   \"FR-11\",\n   \"NFR-9\"\n  ]\n },\n \"designCorrections\": [\n  \"system-design.md C3 posts `confirmPassword`; the real field is `confirm` (resetPasswordSchema / acceptInviteSchema / changePasswordSchema).\",\n  \"system-design.md R3 says INVALID_TOKEN is 400; src/server/http.ts maps it to 410.\",\n  \"system-design.md C5 doesn't cover common-password errors on /api/account/password: they arrive under fieldErrors.password and must be remapped to newPassword on the client. Fix this in ChangePasswordForm, not in the service (NFR-13).\"\n ],\n \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n{\n \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:10:00Z\",\n \"phase\": \"architect\",\n \"version\": \"1.0\",\n \"unauthenticatedBehaviour\": {\n  \"description\": \"middleware.ts (existing): unauthenticated /api/* requests other than /api/health, /api/auth/* and public-routes.ts paths return 401 { error: { code: 'UNAUTHENTICATED' } }; unauthenticated (app) page requests redirect to /login?callbackUrl=<path>.\",\n  \"requirementIds\": [\n   \"FR-11\",\n   \"NFR-9\"\n  ]\n },\n \"designCorrections\": [\n  \"system-design.md C3 posts `confirmPassword`; the real field is `confirm` (resetPasswordSchema / acceptInviteSchema / changePasswordSchema).\",\n  \"system-design.md R3 says INVALID_TOKEN is 400; src/server/http.ts maps it to 410.\",\n  \"system-design.md C5 doesn't cover common-password errors on /api/account/password: they arrive under fieldErrors.password and must be remapped to newPassword on the client. Fix this in ChangePasswordForm, not in the service (NFR-13).\"\n ],\n \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\nsrc/app/(app):\nacco