omponents](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/integrations/styled-components.md)\n- [Integrations](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/integrations/tailwindcss/tailwindcss-v4.md)\n- [Theme scoping](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/integrations/theme-scoping.md)\n- [Material Icons](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/material-icons.md)\n- [Migrating from deprecated APIs](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/migrating-from-deprecated-apis.md)\n- [Migrating from JSS (optional)](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/migrating-from-jss.md)\n- [Migrating to Pigment CSS](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/migrating-to-pigment-css.md)\n- [Migration from v0.x to v1](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/migration-v0x.md)\n- [Migration from v3 to v4](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/migration-v3.md)\n- [Migrating to v5: getting started](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/migration-v4.md)\n- [Migration from @material-ui/pickers](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/pickers-migration.md)\n- [Troubleshooting](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/troubleshooting.md)\n- [Migration](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/upgrade-to-grid-v2.md)\n- [Native color](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/upgrade-to-native-color.md)\n- [Upgrade to v6: getting started](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/upgrade-to-v6.md)\n- [Upgrade to v7: getting started](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/upgrade-to-v7.md)\n- [Upgrade to v9: getting started](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/upgrade-to-v9.md)\n- [Breaking changes: components](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/v5-component-changes.md)\n- [Breaking changes: style and theme](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/v5-style-changes.md)\n- [Migrating from deprecated APIs](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/migration/v7/migrating-from-deprecated-apis.md)\n- [Accordion](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-accordion.md)\n- [Alert](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-alert.md)\n- [App Bar](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-app-bar.md)\n- [Autocomplete](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-autocomplete.md)\n- [Avatar](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-avatar.md)\n- [Backdrop](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-backdrop.md)\n- [Badge](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-badge.md)\n- [Bottom Navigation](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-bottom-navigation.md)\n- [Box](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-box.md)\n- [Breadcrumbs](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-breadcrumbs.md)\n- [Button Group](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-button-group.md)\n- [Button](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-button.md)\n- [Card](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-card.md)\n- [Checkbox](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-checkbox.md)\n- [Chip](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-chip.md)\n- [Click-Away Listener](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-click-away-listener.md)\n- [Container](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-container.md)\n- [CssBaseline](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-css-baseline.md)\n- [Dialog](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-dialog.md)\n- [Divider](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-divider.md)\n- [Drawer](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-drawer.md)\n- [Floating Action Button](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-floating-action-button.md)\n- [Grid](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-grid.md)\n- [Image List](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-image-list.md)\n- [InitColorSchemeScript](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-init-color-scheme-script.md)\n- [Link](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-link.md)\n- [List](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/r