a skip rather than inventing 7A/7B. I checked it with temporary 7A data (removed afterwards): it runs the same twice, and the two forced students land at 73%, below the 85% target. The e2e creates its own data.\n\n**Other notes**\n- The dev artifacts in `artifacts/dev/` belonged to SH-4, so I replaced `dev-log.md` and `task-completion-markers.json` with SH-7 versions instead of appending. The markers now list TASK-1 to TASK-19 for SH-7.\n- The Attendance student tab is registered, but no page draws the student tab bar yet. Nothing in this ticket renders it.\n- I left the old `next dev` already running on :3000 alone and did all runs on :3100.","ttft_ms":3267,"type":"result","duration_ms":1573717,"uuid":"f72d9f66-3e14-4caf-a00c-d2ae412f0f88","ttft_stream_ms":2159,"time_to_request_ms":128,"first_content_frame_ms":2159,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":210,"outputTokens":100466,"cacheReadInputTokens":18991122,"cacheCreationInputTokens":253418,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":7.835728399999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":18725,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":253418,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
