 `studentTabs` is not rendered by any page; it is an extension point only. The Attendance entry is registered, but the student pages have no tab bar to show it. Not in this ticket's scope.\n6. **Unrelated server on :3000.** A stale `next dev` from 2026-10-27 is running on :3000. I did not touch it. All runs used :3100.\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T11:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"completed\": [\n    \"TASK-1\",\n    \"TASK-2\",\n    \"TASK-3\",\n    \"TASK-4\",\n    \"TASK-5\",\n    \"TASK-6\",\n    \"TASK-7\",\n    \"TASK-8\",\n    \"TASK-9\",\n    \"TASK-10\",\n    \"TASK-11\",\n    \"TASK-12\",\n    \"TASK-13\",\n    \"TASK-14\",\n    \"TASK-15\",\n    \"TASK-16\",\n    \"TASK-17\",\n    \"TASK-18\",\n    \"TASK-19\"\n  ]\n}\nOn branch master\nUntracked files:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\n\n\t../../../.CFUserTextEncoding\n\t../../../.anaconda/\n\t../../../.android/\n\t../../../.aws/\n\t../../../.bash_profile\n\t../../../.cache/\n\t../../../.claude.json\n\t../../../.claude.json.backup\n\t../../../.claude/\n\t../../../.cocoapods/\n\t../../../.conda/\n\t../../../.config/\n\t../../../.cups/\n\t../../../.cursor/\n\t../../../.emulator_console_auth_token\n\t../../../.eslintrc\n\t../../../.gem/\n\t../../../.gitconfig\n\t../../../.gitignore\n\t../../../.gradle/\n\t../../../.husky/\n\t../../../.ipython/\n\t../../../.jupyter/\n\t../../../.lesshst\n\t../../../.local/\n\t../../../.node-gyp/\ndd8bf49 cursor: empty commit to allow worktree creation","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Xas5Yhwov5XFX3RpedLFaS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
