{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CVjFDRXG7LqaUFjGr7dVzd","type":"tool_result","content":"FR-16 Validate content fields with Zod in src/lib/validators/content.ts: module title ≤120, lesson title ≤150, contentMarkdown ≤100,000 chars, estimatedMinutes 1–600, link URLs http(s) only, and videoUrl YouTube/Vimeo only. | None\nFR-21 Students see a per-module progress bar ('3 of 5 complete'), a course-level progress bar and a 'Continue' button that opens the first incomplete visible lesson. | None\nFR-22 Teacher controls on the Content tab: 'Add module', a per-module menu (edit, publish now, schedule, unpublish, delete, move up/down) and 'Add lesson' per module. | None\nFR-23 Lessons can be reordered within and across modules with @dnd-kit/sortable drag handles on MUI Accordion/List items, with up/down IconButtons as the keyboard alternative. The order persists through POST /api/courses/:id/content/reorder with the full ordering { modules: [{ id, lessonIds: [] }] }. | None\nFR-24 Deleting a module that contains lessons requires typing the module title in a confirmation Dialog. | None\nFR-27 The lesson editor has an attachments section (FileUpload with reorder) and a links section (title + URL rows). Both are saved via PATCH /api/lessons/:id as attachments and links arrays. | None\nFR-28 Lesson status controls are Save draft, Publish now, and Schedule. Schedule uses an MUI date-time picker in the school timezone and the time must be in the future. | None\nFR-29 Autosave the draft every 10 seconds while there are unsaved changes, show a 'Saved HH:mm' indicator, and warn on navigation away when changes are unsaved. | None\nFR-32 Lesson viewer /courses/[courseId]/lessons/[lessonId] shows the video embed, attachment list, links, estimated time and Previous/Next navigation across modules, limited to lessons visible to the caller. | None\nFR-34 Teachers get a 'Progress' Drawer on the lesson viewer that lists enrolled students with Viewed/Completed status and dates, served by GET /api/lessons/:id/progress (manage). | None\nFR-35 Register a 'Learning' student tab showing per-course content progress (course, lessons completed / visible, percentage, last activity) via GET /api/students/:id/learning (assertCanViewStudent). | None\nFR-38 Register the notification type content.lesson_published (category ACADEMIC, default email false). 'Publish now' that makes a lesson visible notifies ACTIVE enrolled students. | None\nFR-43 Content API: GET/POST /api/courses/:id/modules (GET filters by visibility per role and includes lessons and the caller's progress), PATCH/DELETE /api/modules/:id, POST /api/modules/:id/lessons, GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/lessons/:id, using the PRD response/error envelope and the access checks in the API table. | None\nFR-47 Seed data: MATH-7A gets 3 modules ('Number Sense', 'Fractions', 'Geometry Basics') with 3 published lessons each of realistic Markdown, one with a YouTube video and one with a seeded PDF from prisma/seed-assets/, plus one draft lesson and one lesson scheduled 7 days ahead. ENG-7A gets 2 modules × 2 lessons. Sam has completed 4 MATH-7A lessons. | None\nFR-48 Tests: unit tests for the filename sanitiser, video URL parser, visibility rule and access registry dispatch; integration tests for upload → attach → download with access checks and for the orphan purge; a Playwright test where a teacher creates and publishes a lesson with an attachment and a student completes it. | None","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ed4e388-5ff3-479e-ba38-660b1be74fc5","uuid":"27b7a2d3-08ff-4a8e-8ca9-bf98006fdf78","timestamp":"2026-11-07T00:28:30.118Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"FR-16 Validate content fields with Zod in src/lib/validators/content.ts: module title ≤120, lesson title ≤150, contentMarkdown ≤100,000 chars, estimatedMinutes 1–600, link URLs http(s) only, and videoUrl YouTube/Vimeo only. | None\nFR-21 Students see a per-module progress bar ('3 of 5 complete')