{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013wFjbuRNANqZz1f2sH4tBE","type":"tool_result","content":"## StudentAssignmentRow {\"description\":\"Row for student/parent lists. submission is the toStudentSubmission shape without history or text/files (summary only).\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"assignment\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/AssignmentSummary\"},\"group\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"UPCOMING\",\"MISSING\",\"SUBMITTED\",\"RETURNED\",\"CLOSED\"],\"description\":\"Server-computed, first match wins: RETURNED (submission RETURNED) \\u2192 SUBMITTED (submission exists) \\u2192 UPCOMING (dueAt > now) \\u2192 MISSING (missingWhere) \\u2192 CLOSED (past due but exempt or NO_SUBMISSION; UI lists it under 'Past due' with no missing badge). FR-18 'Past due (missing)' = MISSING.\"},\"exempt\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"submission\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"nullable\":true,\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/SubmissionStatus\"},\"attemptNumber\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"submittedAt\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"date-time\"},\"isLate\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"finalScore\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/Decimal\",\"nullable\":true},\"returnedAt\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"date-time\",\"nullable\":true}}}}}\n== POST /api/assignments/{assignmentId}/return Bulk 'Return all graded'. Auth: assertCanManageCourse. Default set = gradedAt != null AND status SUBMITTED. Supplied ids that are ungraded/already returned/not in this assignment are skipped and reported. One updateMany, then notifyStudentAndParents(assignment.returned) per student and one audit row per submission.\nnull {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"submissionIds\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}}\n{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"returned\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"skipped\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"submissionId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"NOT_GRADED\",\"ALREADY_RETURNED\",\"NOT_FOUND\"]}}}}}}\n['VALIDATION_ERROR', 'FORBIDDEN', 'NOT_FOUND']\n== POST /api/assignments/{assignmentId}/grade-offline 'Grade without submission'. Auth: assertCanManageCourse. Student must be ACTIVE-enrolled with no existing submission. Creates the attemptNumber 0 Submission (text null, no files, submittedAt = gradedAt, penalty 0) using the same rubric/raw-score validation as PUT /grade. return:true also returns it. Audit submission.grade_offline.\nnull {\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"studentId\"],\"properties\":{\"studentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"rawScore\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/Decimal\"},\"feedback\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":10000},\"rubricScores\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/RubricScore\"}},\"return\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"default\":false}}}\n{\"description\":\"201\",\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/Submission\"}\n['VALIDATION_ERROR (score out of range / rubric incomplete / student not enrolled)', 'FORBIDDEN', 'NOT_FOUND', 'CONFLICT (submission already exists — grade that one)']\n== PUT /api/assignments/{assignmentId}/exemptions/{studentId} Exempt a student (idempotent upsert of GradeExemption). Auth: assertCanManageCourse; student must be enrolled. Effects: removed from missing, no reminders, cannot submit; row is the PRD-11 exclusion flag. Audit assignment.exempt.\nnull {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":500}}}\n{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"assignmentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"studentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"exempt\":{\"const\":true},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"nullable\":true}}}\n['VALIDATION_ERROR (student not enrolled)', 'FORBIDDEN', 'NOT_FOUND']\n== DELETE /api/assignments/{assignmentId}/exemptions/{studentId} Remove an exemption (idempotent deleteMany). Auth: assertCanManageCourse. Audit assignment.unexempt.\nnull {}\n{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"assignmentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"studentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"exempt\":{\"const\":false}}}\n['FORBIDDEN', 'NOT_FOUND']\n== GET /api/submissions/{submissionId} Submission detail for the grading main panel and student/parent results. Auth: submitting student, linked parent, or course manager; anyone else NOT_FOUND. Managers get the full shape incl. history (with files); student/parent get toStudentSubmission. Grading page caches and prefetches next/prev (NFR-3).\nnull {}\n{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/Submission\"}\n['UNAUTHENTICATED', 'NOT_FOUND']\n== PUT /api/submissions/{submissionId}/grade Save a grade (status stays SUBMITTED, invisible to student) or Save & return (return:true → RETURNED + returnedAt in the same transaction, then notifyStudentAndParents(assignment.returned, 'Course: Title — {final}/{max}')). Auth: assertCanManageCourse. Server computes rawScore (rubric) and finalScore = computeFinalScore(raw, penalty). Re-grading a RETURNED submission is allowed and keeps it RETURNED. Audit submission.grade (+ submission.return).\nnull {\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/GradeInput\"}\n{\"description\":\"Full manager shape\",\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/Submission\"}\n['VALIDATION_ERROR (score/penalty range; rubric scores missing, duplicated or over criterion max)', 'FORBIDDEN', 'NOT_FOUND']\n== GET /api/me/assignments Data for /assignments. STUDENT: own rows across ACTIVE enrollments, filtered by tab (UPCOMING sorted by dueAt asc; MISSING = missingWhere; SUBMITTED; RETURNED) and courseId. PARENT: same, for studentId (linked child; defaults to the only child). TEACHER: 'To grade' = SUBMITTED, ungraded submissions in courses where teacherId or coTeacherIds includes them, oldest submittedAt first. ADMIN: 'To grade' across all courses. Fires publishOnce for newly visible SCHEDULED rows (student/parent).\n{\"studentId\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"PARENT only\"}, \"tab\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"UPCOMING\", \"MISSING\", \"SUBMITTED\", \"RETURNED\"], \"default\": \"UPCOMING\", \"description\": \"STUDENT/PARENT only\"}, \"courseId\": {\"type\": \"string\"}} {}\n{\"oneOf\":[{\"title\":\"student/parent\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"view\":{\"const\":\"student\"},\"studentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"children\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/UserRef\"},\"description\":\"PARENT only, for the child selector\"},\"courses\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}},\"description\":\"for the course filter\"},\"items\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/StudentAssignmentRow\"}}}},{\"title\":\"to-grade (TEACHER/ADMIN)\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"view\":{\"const\":\"toGrade\"},\"items\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"submissionId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"assignment\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/AssignmentSummary\"},\"student\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/UserRef\"},\"submittedAt\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"date-time\"},\"isLate\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}}}}}}]}\n['UNAUTHENTICATED', 'FORBIDDEN (studentId not a linked child)']\n== GET /api/students/{studentId}/assignments Per-student assignment list across the student's ACTIVE enrollments (students/[id]/assignments page). Auth: assertCanViewStudent. Per course: viewers who manage that course get full grade fields; everyone else gets toStudentSubmission (D8). Only visible, non-archived assignments.\n{\"courseId\": {\"type\": \"string\"}} {}\n{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"student\":{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/UserRef\"},\"items\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/sharedSchemas/StudentAssignmentRow\"}],\"properties\":{\"canManage\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}}}}}}\n['UNAUTHENTICATED', 'FORBIDDEN', 'NOT_FOUND (student)']","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"80a968fd-48d7-4da9-a01e-aaa2035d3ca9","u