ssignment/submission file resolvers — ✓ complete\n- TASK-10: course/assignment/duplicate route handlers — ✓ complete\n- TASK-11: submission/grading route handlers — ✓ complete\n- TASK-12: /api/me/assignments + /api/students/[id]/assignments — ✓ complete\n- TASK-13: next.config.js header split (D11) — ✓ complete\n- TASK-14: MarkdownView + MarkdownEditor — ✓ complete\n- TASK-15: FileUpload + FileList — ✓ complete\n- TASK-16: course-tabs / navigation / student-tabs entries — ✓ complete\n- TASK-17: RubricBuilder — ✓ complete\n- TASK-18: AssignmentForm + new/edit pages — ✓ complete\n- TASK-19: AssignmentList — ✓ complete\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-10\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T13:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Prisma schema: enums QuizStatus/QuestionType/ResultsVisibility/AttemptStatus/ScoringPolicy and models Quiz, Question, QuizAttempt, QuizAnswer (@@id[attemptId,questionId]), QuizAccommodation exactly per PRD FR-1, plus relations/indexes from system-design §2 and back-relations on Course/User. Migration via `prisma migrate dev --create-only`, then append raw SQL partial unique index quiz_attempt_one_in_progress_uq (status='IN_PROGRESS') and add a schema comment pointing to it. Never use db push (ADR-2).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"prisma/schema.prisma\",\n        \"prisma/migrations/20261110000000_add_quizzes/migration.sql\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-1\",\n        \"FR-19\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Zod validators (client-safe): quizSettingsSchema (superRefine availableUntil>availableFrom, timeLimit<=window; timeLimit 1-300|null, maxAttempts 1-10), questionSchema discriminatedUnion on type (points 0.5-100, 2-8 options, >=1 correct for MC, 1-10 accepted), answerResponseSchema (type-agnostic, text<=10000), manualGradeSchema {pointsAwarded step 0.5, feedback?} (field name per api-contracts, NOT `points`), accommodationSchema, reorderSchema. Unit tests.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/lib/validators/quiz.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/quiz/quiz-validators.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-2\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"NFR-6\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Pure core grading.ts (no Prisma client; import dec/fixed2/Decimal from @/server/assignments/grading-math): gradeAnswer, needsReview (A8 derived rule), normalizeShortAnswer, computeDeadline, attemptLimit, resultsVisible, canPublish, applyScoringPolicy (HIGHEST/LATEST/AVERAGE over GRADED), seededShuffle (string hash + mulberry32), ANSWER_GRACE_MS=30000. Unit tests per system-design §6 incl. FR-2 example ({A,B}->0,{A}->2) and ' Photosynthesis '.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/quiz/grading.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/quiz/grading.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-9\",\n        \"FR-13\",\n        \"FR-20\",\n        \"FR-22\",\n        \"FR-23\",\n        \"FR-28\",\n        \"NFR-7\",\n        \"NFR-8\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Student serializers toStudentQuiz/toStudentAttempt (incl. serverNow, options shuffled via seededShuffle(attempt.id) when shuffleOptions)/toStudentResult built by explicit allow-list; correct/explanation only when resultsVisible && showCorrectAnswers. Unit test walks output recursively asserting no `correct` key before visibility (AC-7).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/quiz/serializers.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/quiz/serializers.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"NFR-1\",\n        \"FR-11\",\n        \"FR-21\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"Integrations: add notification types quiz.published (ACADEMIC, STUDENT, defaultEmail false) and quiz.results_released (ACADEMIC, STUDENT+PARENT, defaultEmail true); register('quiz', resolver) file context — course manager, or course viewer when quiz PUBLISHED.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/notifications/types.ts\",\n        \"src/server/files/contexts.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-29\",\n        \"FR-30\",\n        \"FR-39\",\n        \"NFR-5\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"access.ts: assertCanAccessAttempt(user, attempt, {write}) — owner (write), manager via assertCanManageCourse, linked PARENT read-only only when resultsVisible; otherwise NOT_FOUND.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/quiz/access.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-3\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-34\",\n        \"NFR-5\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"attempt-service.ts: startOrResumeAttempt (window/limit CONFLICTs, cuid up front, seeded questionOrder, frozen deadlineAt, P2002 -> re-read and resume; 201 vs 200 signal), getAttempt (ensureNotExpired), saveAnswer hot path (1 attempt read + 1 upsert, no Quiz/Question load; deadline+30s -> auto-submit + CONFLICT 'Time is up'), submitAttempt(id,{auto}) idempotent via status claim, ensureNotExpired, gradeAnswerManually (points<=question.points, audit after commit), recomputeAttempt(tx,id), getStudentQuizScore (returns isPractice; no endpoint).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/quiz/attempt-service.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": 