tps://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-floating-action-button.md)\n- [Grid](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-grid.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-image-list.md)\n- [InitColorSchemeScript](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-init-color-scheme-script.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-link.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-list.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-masonry.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-menu.md)\n- [Menubar New](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-menubar.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-modal.md)\n- [No SSR](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-no-ssr.md)\n- [Number Field New](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-number-field.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-pagination.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-paper.md)\n- [Popover](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-popover.md)\n- [Popper](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-popper.md)\n- [Portal](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-portal.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-progress.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-radio-button.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-rating.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-select.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-skeleton.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-slider.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-snackbar.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-speed-dial.md)\n- [Stack](https://llms.mui.com/material-ui/9.5.0/react-stack.md)\n- [Native support](https://llms.m