e database rather than through the date picker. Its accessibility check covers only the main page area, because the existing sidebar fails the check on its own.\n- **How the migration was made:** the database user isn't allowed to create the temporary database `prisma migrate dev` needs. I generated the SQL by comparing the live database to the schema instead, then applied it with `migrate deploy` (never `db push`). A follow-up comparison shows no differences.\n- **Port 3000:** that's a dev server from your `schoolhub-prds` project. I left it alone and ran this app on port 3100.\n\n**Problems outside this ticket, logged in `dev-log.md` but not fixed:**\n- The shared email renderer sometimes produces invalid characters, so some notification emails fail to save. In-app notifications still arrive.\n- The assignments points validator has the same bug as fix 3 above.\n- The sidebar has the accessibility issue mentioned above.\n\nI replaced the leftover SH-9 `dev-log.md` and `task-completion-markers.json` with SH-10 versions and didn't touch `dev-rerun-count.json`. The old SH-9 `security-scan-report.json` is still in `artifacts/dev/`.","ttft_ms":2168,"type":"result","duration_ms":2337175,"uuid":"6be59359-c892-4259-a943-d0347bc3d97b","ttft_stream_ms":1749,"time_to_request_ms":145,"first_content_frame_ms":1750,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":244,"outputTokens":172327,"cacheReadInputTokens":28602587,"cacheCreationInputTokens":357226,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":11.005028400000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":26227,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":340271,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":16955,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
