ER_GRACE_MS`), the same as the maintenance sweep. A GET inside the grace window therefore doesn't race the client's final save.\n- **Edit lock compares values, not keys:** the builder sends the whole question, so the lock only rejects keys whose values actually changed.\n- **Prompt images (FR-39):** they are uploaded with context `'quiz'` and embedded as `![](/api/files/<id>?inline=1)`. On question save, the service attaches the referenced unattached `quiz` files the caller owns (contextId = quizId), so `quizResolver` controls who can read them.\n      71 artifacts/dev/dev-log.md\n M .pdlc/workspace-memory.json\n M .task-arch-api-contracts.log\n M .task-arch-api-contracts.md\n M .task-arch-design-system.log\n M .task-arch-design-system.md\n M .task-arch-research-reqs.log\n M .task-arch-research-reqs.md\n M .task-arch-research-stack.log\n M .task-arch-research-stack.md\n M .task-dev-main.log\n M .task-dev-main.md\n M .task-dev-planning-main.log\n M .task-dev-planning-main.md\n M .task-intake-main.log\n M .task-intake-main.md\n M artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\n M artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n M artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\n M artifacts/architect/system-design.md\n M artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\n M artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json\n M artifacts/dev-planning/file-ownership-matrix.json\n M artifacts/dev-planning/file-structure.md\n M artifacts/dev-planning/implementation-plan.json\n M artifacts/dev-planning/module-dependencies.json\n M artifacts/intake/handoff-to-architect.json\n M artifacts/intake/requirements.json\n M artifacts/intake/tech-stack.json\n M artifacts/intake/user-stories.md\n M artifacts/telemetry/daemon-handoff.json\n M artifacts/telemetry/knowledge-log.jsonl\n M artifacts/telemetry/metering.jsonl\n M artifacts/telemetry/phase-sessions.json\n?? .claude/\ndb1ffd3 Project startup\n8fab7d6 Initial commit","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"