{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0181r3FMm3XMNnQpuxUrer53","type":"tool_result","content":"# Project Knowledge Base\n<!-- Generated by Cortana Knowledge Builder -- vendor-agnostic, works with any AI tool -->\n<!-- Last updated: 2026-11-06T05:28:22.653Z -->\n\n## Overview\n- **Name**: schoolhub\n- **Type**: data-engineering (0.85% confidence)\n- **Language**: typescript\n- **Framework**: react\n\n## What This System Does\n\n### Page Routes\n- `/(app)/account/notifications`\n- `/(app)/account/security`\n- `/(app)/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment`\n- `/(app)/admin/courses`\n- `/(app)/admin/email-log`\n- `/(app)/admin/sections/[id]`\n- `/(app)/admin/sections`\n- `/(app)/courses/[courseId]`\n- `/(app)/courses/[courseId]/roster`\n- `/(app)/dashboard`\n- `/(app)/my-courses`\n- `/(app)/notifications`\n- `/(app)/students/[id]/courses`\n- `/(auth)/forgot-password`\n- `/(auth)/invite/[token]`\n- `/(auth)/login`\n- `/(auth)/reset-password/[token]`\n- `/(public)`\n\n### Capabilities (from tests)\n- dashboard page (/dashboard)\n- landing page (/)\n- authorizeCredentials\n- acceptInvite\n- password reset\n- changePassword\n- ConfirmDialog\n- DataTable\n- ForgotPasswordForm (FR-17)\n- TokenPasswordForm (FR-13, FR-14, FR-16, FR-19)\n- ChangePasswordForm (FR-20)\n- passwordChecks\n- safeCallbackUrl\n- schemas\n- formatInSchoolTz\n- env.ts\n- no-restricted-imports (ADR-5: MUI-only)\n- ok/paginated/apiError envelopes\n- withHandler error mapping\n- parsePagination\n- parseBody / parseQuery\n- computeLockout\n- loginErrorMessage\n- resolvePrefs\n- nextRetry\n- isSafeRelativeLink\n- expandStudentRecipients\n- registry helpers\n- assertPasswordAllowed\n- isPublicPath\n\n### NPM Scripts\n- `dev`: `next dev`\n- `build`: `next build`\n- `start`: `next start`\n- `lint`: `next lint`\n- `typecheck`: `tsc --noEmit`\n- `test`: `vitest run`\n- `test:e2e`: `playwright test`\n- `db:migrate`: `prisma migrate dev`\n- `db:deploy`: `prisma migrate deploy`\n- `db:seed