and roll back with a red outline on the cell if the server rejects them.\n- **List pages:** the grading-scales page and the admin report-card list use the data grid directly, not the shared `DataTable`. `DataTable` pages and searches on the server, but \"Publish all\" needs the whole filtered list loaded at once.\n- **Migration:** generated with `prisma migrate diff`, because the database user can't create a shadow database (same as SH-10). It was applied with `migrate deploy`, never `db push`.\n- **Not built:** the optional performance test (35 students × 80 items, 600 × 8 report cards) from the system design wasn't in the task list.\n\nThe full log with the task checklist is in `artifacts/dev/dev-log.md`. All 33 IDs are in `artifacts/dev/task-completion-markers.json` under ticket SH-11. I didn't touch `dev-rerun-count.json`, and nothing is committed.","ttft_ms":7630,"type":"result","duration_ms":2573449,"uuid":"a56ed848-583b-40a8-aa25-d3c00cd990c5","ttft_stream_ms":6251,"time_to_request_ms":160,"first_content_frame_ms":6252,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":240,"outputTokens":182290,"cacheReadInputTokens":32141162,"cacheCreationInputTokens":409362,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":13.308635399999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":24731,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":13751,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":395611,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
