{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017KvF2MNfkyxqhSXS9AVi7W","type":"tool_result","content":"approvals\narchitect\ndev\ndev-planning\nintake\nqa\nrun-summary.json\ntelemetry\nui-verification\n\nartifacts/approvals:\narchitect-approval.json\ndev-planning-approval.json\nintake-approval.json\n\nartifacts/architect:\napi-contracts.json\nhandoff-to-dev-planning.json\nrequirements-analysis-notes.md\nsystem-design.md\ntech-stack-decisions.md\nthreat-model-notes.json\n\nartifacts/dev:\ndev-log.md\ndev-rerun-count.json\nsecurity-scan-report.json\ntask-completion-markers.json\n\nartifacts/dev-planning:\nfile-ownership-matrix.json\nfile-structure.md\nimplementation-plan.json\nmodule-dependencies.json\n\nartifacts/intake:\nhandoff-to-architect.json\nrequirements.json\ntech-stack.json\nuser-stories.md\n\nartifacts/qa:\ncoverage-report.md\nqa-report.md\n\nartifacts/telemetry:\napi-retries.jsonl\ndaemon-handoff.json\nknowledge-log.jsonl\nmetering.jsonl\n M .pdlc/workspace-memory.json\n M .task-arch-api-contracts.log\n M .task-arch-api-contracts.md\n M .task-arch-design-system.log\n M .task-arch-design-system.md\n M .task-arch-research-reqs.log\n M .task-arch-research-reqs.md\n M .task-arch-research-stack.log\n M .task-arch-research-stack.md\n M .task-dev-main.log\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-12\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T16:38:39Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Prisma migration: AnnouncementStatus/AudienceType enums; Announcement (+lastRemindedAt), AnnouncementAudience, AnnouncementAttachment, AnnouncementRead models exactly per PRD FR-1 block; indexes from system-design §1; back-relations User.announcements, User.announcementReads, FileObject.announcementAttachments. Run prisma migrate dev --name add_announcements under the fixed folder name.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"prisma/schema.prisma\",\n        \"prisma/migrations/20261112