st matchesAudience for every type × flag × role with hand-built keys.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/announcements/audience.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/announcements/audience-match.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"TASK-1\"\n      ],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-3\",\n        \"FR-4\",\n        \"FR-5\",\n        \"FR-6\",\n        \"FR-7\",\n        \"FR-8\",\n        \"FR-14\",\n        \"FR-18\",\n        \"FR-22\",\n        \"NFR-2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"Register notification types 'announcement.published' (COMMUNICATION, defaultEmail true, mandatoryInApp false, ALL roles) and 'announcement.reminder' (COMMUNICATION, defaultEmail true, mandatoryInApp true). Add optional NotifyInput.mandatoryInApp override passed to resolvePrefs (one-line change, A9).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/notifications/types.ts\",\n        \"src/server/notifications/notify.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 0.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"FR-26\",\n        \"NFR-8\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"announcements-service.ts write side: visibleWhere, isVisible, displayStatus, assertCanTarget (admin anything; teacher COURSE as teacherId/coTeacherIds, SECTION as homeroom; else 403), createAnnouncement (transaction + attachFiles, zero-recipient NO_RECIPIENTS check except drafts), updateAnnouncement (author/admin else 404, archived non-admin 409, PUBLISHED→draft 409, retarget check on resulting values, audit on admin edits, never clears notifiedAt), archiveAnnouncement (idempotent, audit), claimAndNotify (atomic notifiedAt claim, chunks of 1000, generic-notification email, 300-char body, mandatoryInApp = requiresAck). Unit test assertCanTarget cases.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/announcements/announcements-service.ts\",\n        \"tests/un